('6aad7ac7-1d1b-5768-aaa0-28d67e51711b','e49e5cdc-9d32-529a-b921-67c2fff3fe7c',2,'preposition','A1','S1','W2',null,'[{"phrase":"past it","register":"spoken","definition_en":"too old to be able to do what you used to do, or too old to be useful","translation":"خیلی پیرتر از آن است که بتوانید کاری را که قبلا انجام می دادید انجام دهید یا خیلی پیرتر از آن که مفید باشید","example":"People seem to think that just because I’m retired, I’m past it.","example_translation":"به نظر می رسد مردم فکر می کنند که من فقط به دلیل بازنشستگی از آن گذشته ام.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001583937.mp3"},{"phrase":"be past due","register":null,"definition_en":"something that is past due has not been paid or done by the time it should have been","translation":"چیزی که سررسید گذشته است تا زمانی که باید پرداخت نشده یا انجام نشده است","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""}]'::jsonb),
('c28f297e-f745-5c4c-acf1-d1663b70020e','e49e5cdc-9d32-529a-b921-67c2fff3fe7c',3,'noun','A1','S1','W2',null,'[{"phrase":"the past","register":null,"definition_en":"the time that existed before the present","translation":"زمانی که قبل از زمان حال وجود داشته است","example":"The lake was smaller in the past.","example_translation":"این دریاچه در گذشته کوچکتر بود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001583941.mp3"},{"phrase":"all in the past","register":"spoken","definition_en":"used to say that an unpleasant experience has ended and can be forgotten","translation":"می گفت که یک تجربه ناخوشایند به پایان رسیده است و می توان آن را فراموش کرد","example":"You mustn’t think about it. It’s all in the past now.","example_translation":"نباید بهش فکر کنی اکنون همه اینها در گذشته است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000371769.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
