('8acfd260-6c7e-573c-8554-7b2b838c678c','2ef9afbb-d626-5a75-86c3-a7100d52aa28',1,'verb','A1','S1','W1',null,'[{"phrase":"play ball","register":null,"definition_en":"to throw , kick , hit, or catch a ball as a game or activity","translation":"پرتاب کردن، لگد زدن، ضربه زدن یا گرفتن توپ به عنوان بازی یا فعالیت","example":"Jim and Karl were playing ball in the backyard.","example_translation":"جیم و کارل در حیاط خلوت مشغول توپ بازی بودند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001560329.mp3"},{"phrase":"play games","register":null,"definition_en":"to hide your real feelings or wishes in order to achieve something in a clever or secret way – used to show disapproval","translation":"پنهان کردن احساسات یا آرزوهای واقعی خود برای رسیدن به چیزی به روشی هوشمندانه یا مخفیانه - برای نشان دادن عدم تایید","example":"Stop playing games, Luke, and tell me what you want.","example_translation":"دست از بازی برداری، لوک، و به من بگو چه می خواهی.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001560351.mp3"},{"phrase":"play something by ear","register":null,"definition_en":"to play music that you have heard without having to read written music","translation":"برای پخش موسیقی هایی که شنیده اید بدون نیاز به خواندن موسیقی نوشته شده","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""},{"phrase":"play the game","register":null,"definition_en":"to do things in the way you are expected to do them or in a way that is usual in a particular situation","translation":"انجام کارها به روشی که از شما انتظار می رود یا به روشی که در یک موقعیت خاص معمول است انجام دهید","example":"If you want a promotion, you’ve got to play the game.","example_translation":"اگر می خواهید یک ارتقاء کسب کنید، باید بازی را انجام دهید.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001560362.mp3"},{"phrase":"play your cards right","register":null,"definition_en":"to deal with a situation in the right way, so that you are successful in getting what you want","translation":"با یک موقعیت به روشی درست برخورد کنید تا در رسیدن به آنچه می خواهید موفق باشید","example":"If he plays his cards right, Tony might get a promotion.","example_translation":"اگر کارت هایش را درست بازی کند، تونی ممکن است ترفیع بگیرد.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001055931.mp3"},{"phrase":"play your cards close to your chest","register":null,"definition_en":"to keep secret what you are doing in a situation","translation":"مخفی نگه داشتن کاری که در یک موقعیت انجام می دهید","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""},{"phrase":"play for time","register":null,"definition_en":"to try to delay something so that you have more time to prepare for it or prevent it from happening","translation":"سعی کنید کاری را به تعویق بیندازید تا زمان بیشتری برای آماده شدن برای آن یا جلوگیری از وقوع آن داشته باشید","example":"The rebels may be playing for time while they try to get more weapons.","example_translation":"شورشیان ممکن است در حالی که سعی می‌کنند سلاح‌های بیشتری به دست آورند، برای زمان بازی می‌کنند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000336159.mp3"},{"phrase":"play the market","register":null,"definition_en":"to risk money on the stock market as a way of trying to earn more money","translation":"ریسک کردن پول در بازار سهام به عنوان راهی برای تلاش برای کسب درآمد بیشتر","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""},{"phrase":"play the system","register":null,"definition_en":"to use the rules of a system in a clever way, to gain advantage for yourself","translation":"از قواعد یک سیستم به روشی هوشمندانه استفاده کنید تا برای خود مزیتی کسب کنید","example":"Accountants know how to play the tax system.","example_translation":"حسابداران می دانند چگونه با سیستم مالیاتی بازی کنند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000336175.mp3"},{"phrase":"play hard to get","register":null,"definition_en":"to pretend that you are not sexually interested in someone so that they will become more interested in you","translation":"وانمود کنید که از نظر جنسی به کسی علاقه ندارید تا او بیشتر به شما علاقه مند شود","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""},{"phrase":"play hooky","register":"old-fashioned","definition_en":"to stay away from school without permission","translation":"دوری از مدرسه بدون اجازه","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""},{"phrase":"play with fire","register":null,"definition_en":"to do something that could have a very dangerous or harmful result","translation":"انجام کاری که می تواند نتیجه بسیار خطرناک یا مضری داشته باشد","example":"Dating the boss’s daughter is playing with fire.","example_translation":"قرار ملاقات با دختر رئیس با آتش بازی می کند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001767193.mp3"},{"phrase":"play to your strengths","register":null,"definition_en":"to do what you are able to do well, rather than trying to do other things","translation":"به جای تلاش برای انجام کارهای دیگر، کاری را که قادر به انجام آن هستید به خوبی انجام دهید","example":"It is up to us to play to our strengths and try to control the game.","example_translation":"این به ما بستگی دارد که با قدرت بازی کنیم و سعی کنیم بازی را کنترل کنیم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001219.mp3"},{"phrase":"play the field","register":null,"definition_en":"to have sexual relationships with a lot of different people","translation":"داشتن روابط جنسی با افراد مختلف","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""},{"phrase":"play fast and loose with something","register":null,"definition_en":"to not be careful about what you do, especially by not obeying the law or a rule","translation":"مراقب کارهایی که انجام می دهید نباشید، به خصوص با رعایت نکردن قانون یا قانون","example":"They played fast and loose with investors’ money.","example_translation":"آنها با پول سرمایه گذاران سریع و ضعیف بازی کردند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001560389.mp3"},{"phrase":"play happy families","register":null,"definition_en":"to spend time with your family , doing normal things, especially so that your family appears to be happy when it is not","translation":"برای گذراندن وقت با خانواده، انجام کارهای عادی، به خصوص به طوری که خانواده شما خوشحال به نظر می رسد در حالی که خوشحال نیست","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""}]'::jsonb),
('5a34e60c-6914-5a3e-88ae-f41f62eb274b','2ef9afbb-d626-5a75-86c3-a7100d52aa28',2,'noun','A1','S1','W2',null,'[{"phrase":"play on words","register":null,"definition_en":"a use of a word that is interesting or amusing because it can be understood as having two very different meanings","translation":"استفاده از کلمه ای که جالب یا سرگرم کننده است زیرا می توان آن را به دو معنی بسیار متفاوت درک کرد","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""},{"phrase":"play of light","register":null,"definition_en":"patterns made by light as it moves over a surface","translation":"الگوهای ساخته شده توسط نور هنگام حرکت بر روی سطح","example":"the play of light on the water","example_translation":"بازی نور روی آب","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000338970.mp3"},{"phrase":"make a play for something","register":null,"definition_en":"to make an attempt to gain something","translation":"تلاش برای به دست آوردن چیزی","example":"He made a play for the leadership last year.","example_translation":"او سال گذشته برای رهبری یک نمایش ساخت.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000338985.mp3"},{"phrase":"make a play for somebody","register":null,"definition_en":"to try to begin a romantic or sexual relationship with someone","translation":"تلاش برای شروع یک رابطه عاشقانه یا جنسی با کسی","example":"It’s obvious he was making a play for her.","example_translation":"معلوم است که برای او نمایشنامه می‌سازد.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001560518.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
