('5c1ba123-a7fe-5994-905b-96038ccb9ce0','7e1e7339-5849-5d89-b1f0-46bffc0a16b8',1,'noun','B2','S2','W2',null,'[{"phrase":"back on the rails","register":null,"definition_en":"happening or functioning normally again","translation":"دوباره اتفاق می افتد یا به طور عادی کار می کند","example":"The coach was credited with putting the team back on the rails.","example_translation":"این مربی اعتبار داشت که تیم را به ریل بازگرداند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001994884.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
