('cc0c3df0-71c5-5561-b0b2-99de3be72098','c482f0e2-395d-5c76-a210-7cf2f1e5ecd9',1,'noun','A2','S1','W1','[ countable ]','[{"phrase":"at any rate","register":"spoken","definition_en":"used when you are stating one definite fact in a situation that is uncertain or unsatisfactory","translation":"زمانی استفاده می شود که یک واقعیت قطعی را در موقعیتی نامشخص یا رضایت بخش بیان می کنید","example":"They’ve had technical problems – at any rate that’s what they told me.","example_translation":"آنها مشکلات فنی داشته اند - به هر حال این چیزی است که آنها به من گفتند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001565504.mp3"},{"phrase":"at this rate","register":"spoken","definition_en":"used to say what will happen if things continue to happen in the same way as now","translation":"قبلاً می گفت اگر همه چیز به همان روش فعلی ادامه یابد چه اتفاقی می افتد","example":"At this rate we won’t ever be able to afford a holiday.","example_translation":"با این نرخ ما هرگز نمی توانیم تعطیلات را بپردازیم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000476767.mp3"},{"phrase":"at a rate of knots","register":"informal","definition_en":"very quickly","translation":"خیلی سریع","example":"Jack’s getting through the ironing at a rate of knots!","example_translation":"جک با سرعت گره از اتو کردن عبور می کند!","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000476786.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
