('1a165ae5-df42-5b03-920e-0a47a6519d5d','eb30eb00-6c8f-5f26-b926-4af2d6f6bf6c',1,'time somebody is alive','زمانی که کسی زنده است','spoken & written','the period of time when someone is alive','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'زندگی، عمر؛ حیات؛ دوران (شغل)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Learning goes on throughout life.","translation":"یادگیری در طول زندگی ادامه دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001460647.mp3"},{"sentence":"You have your whole life ahead of you.","translation":"شما تمام زندگی خود را در پیش دارید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000520229.mp3"},{"sentence":"For the first time in my life I was happy.","translation":"برای اولین بار در زندگیم خوشحال بودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800074.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve never been so embarrassed in my life!","translation":"هیچ وقت تو زندگیم اینقدر خجالت نکشیده بودم!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800075.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve known John all my life (= since I was born ) .","translation":"من جان را تمام عمرم می شناسم (= از زمانی که به دنیا آمدم).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800076.mp3"},{"sentence":"His main aim in life was to have fun.","translation":"هدف اصلی او در زندگی تفریح ​​بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800081.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was one of the best days of my life .","translation":"یکی از بهترین روزهای زندگیم بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800085.mp3"},{"sentence":"The accident scarred him for life (= for the rest of his life ) .","translation":"تصادف او را برای زندگی (= تا آخر عمر) زخمی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800089.mp3"},{"sentence":"She knew she’d feel guilty for the rest of her life .","translation":"او می دانست که تا آخر عمر احساس گناه می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800094.mp3"},{"sentence":"Raj spent his life caring for others.","translation":"راج زندگی خود را صرف مراقبت از دیگران کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800100.mp3"},{"sentence":"Bonington spent his entire adult life in France.","translation":"بونینگتون تمام دوران بزرگسالی خود را در فرانسه گذراند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800106.mp3"},{"sentence":"We don’t know much about the poet’s early life (= when he was young ) .","translation":"ما از اوایل زندگی شاعر (= در جوانی) چیز زیادی نمی دانیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800111.mp3"},{"sentence":"Poor diet can lead to a whole range of diseases in later life (= when you are older ) .","translation":"رژیم غذایی نامناسب می تواند منجر به طیف وسیعی از بیماری ها در زندگی بعدی شود (= وقتی که سن شما بالاتر است).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800116.mp3"},{"sentence":"She married late in life (= when she was fairly old ) .","translation":"او در اواخر عمر (= زمانی که نسبتاً پیر بود) ازدواج کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800121.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s a life member (= continuing until he dies ) of the club.","translation":"او عضو زندگی (= ادامه دادن تا زمان مرگ) باشگاه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800126.mp3"}]'::jsonb,15),
('a31cb75f-0f42-5520-9ad8-b0d808461fc1','eb30eb00-6c8f-5f26-b926-4af2d6f6bf6c',2,'state of being alive','حالت زنده بودن','spoken & written','the state of being alive','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'حالت زنده بودن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['save somebody’s life The money you give will save the life of a child.','risk your life He risked his life to help Jews during the Second World War.','lose your life (= die ) Hundreds of people lost their lives on the first day of the fighting.','take a/somebody’s life (= kill someone ) All cultures consider it wrong to take a life for no reason.','take your own life (= kill yourself ) He was depressed and decided to take his own life.','claim the life of somebody (= kill someone – used of a thing ) The disease claimed the lives of up to a quarter of the population.','cost lives/cost somebody their life (= result in deaths/in someone’s death ) That decision may have cost him his life.','give your life/lay down your life (= die in order to save other people, or because of a strong belief ) These men gave their lives during the war to keep us free.','endanger the life of somebody They wanted to capture the gunman without endangering the lives of his hostages.','spare somebody’s life (= not kill someone, when you could kill them ) She begged him to spare the life of her son.','be fighting for your life (= be so ill or injured that you might die ) One badly burned man was fighting for his life in hospital.','cling to life (= try to stay alive, even though you are very ill or injured ) She clung to life, despite the pain.','owe your life to somebody (= be still alive because of someone’s actions ) The victim said he owed his life to the stranger who helped him.','take your life in your hands (= put yourself in a dangerous situation ) Just crossing this road is taking your life in your hands.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The right to life is the most basic of human rights.","translation":"حق حیات اساسی ترین حقوق بشر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800131.mp3"},{"sentence":"Danny was a cheerful little boy who loved life.","translation":"دنی پسر کوچولوی شادی بود که عاشق زندگی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800132.mp3"},{"sentence":"Two firefighters risked their lives to save the children.","translation":"دو آتش نشان برای نجات بچه ها جان خود را به خطر انداختند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800139.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('4fb93ce9-15b5-53ff-8165-d7e249395ac7','eb30eb00-6c8f-5f26-b926-4af2d6f6bf6c',3,'way somebody lives','راهی که کسی زندگی می کند','spoken & written','the way you live your life, and what you do and experience during it','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'شیوه زندگی خود و آنچه در طول آن انجام می دهید و تجربه می کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The operation should enable Bobby to lead a normal life.","translation":"این عمل باید بابی را قادر سازد تا زندگی عادی داشته باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001460688.mp3"},{"sentence":"She just wanted to live a quiet life.","translation":"او فقط می خواست یک زندگی آرام داشته باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800188.mp3"},{"sentence":"Having a baby changes your life completely.","translation":"بچه دار شدن زندگی شما را به کلی تغییر می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800189.mp3"},{"sentence":"The family moved to Australia to start a new life .","translation":"خانواده برای شروع یک زندگی جدید به استرالیا نقل مکان کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800195.mp3"},{"sentence":"Ken’s whole life revolved around surfing (= that was the main interest and purpose of his life ) .","translation":"کل زندگی کن حول محور موج سواری می چرخید (= این علاقه و هدف اصلی زندگی او بود).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800199.mp3"},{"sentence":"You shouldn’t let your boyfriend rule your life (= control and affect everything you do ) .","translation":"شما نباید اجازه دهید دوست پسرتان بر زندگی شما حکومت کند (= کنترل و تأثیرگذاری بر هر کاری که انجام می دهید).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000943.mp3"},{"sentence":"My grandmother had a hard life (= a life full of problems ) .","translation":"مادربزرگ من زندگی سختی داشت (= زندگی پر از مشکل ) .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800210.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’s led a very sheltered life (= a life in which you have been protected from unpleasant things ) .","translation":"او یک زندگی بسیار در پناه داشته است (= زندگی که در آن شما از چیزهای ناخوشایند محافظت شده اید).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800215.mp3"},{"sentence":"He had been drawn into a life of crime.","translation":"او به زندگی جنایی کشیده شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001460694.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
('1a23ff3b-a3ae-52f0-90d6-9af85098a4bd','eb30eb00-6c8f-5f26-b926-4af2d6f6bf6c',4,'particular situation/job','موقعیت/شغل خاص','spoken & written','the experiences, activities, and ways of living that are typical of being in a particular job, situation, society etc','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'تجارب، فعالیت‌ها و شیوه‌های زندگی که برای حضور در یک شغل، موقعیت، جامعه و غیره خاص است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Why do so few women enter political life?","translation":"چرا تعداد کمی از زنان وارد زندگی سیاسی می شوند؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800221.mp3"},{"sentence":"the British way of life","translation":"شیوه زندگی بریتانیایی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800222.mp3"},{"sentence":"Noise has become one of the main pollutants of modern city life.","translation":"سر و صدا به یکی از آلاینده های اصلی زندگی شهری مدرن تبدیل شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001460706.mp3"},{"sentence":"He missed the routine of army life.","translation":"او برای روال زندگی ارتشی تنگ شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800227.mp3"},{"sentence":"Are you enjoying married life ?","translation":"آیا از زندگی زناشویی لذت می برید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800228.mp3"},{"sentence":"Now a celebrity chef, he rarely talks about his life as an army cook.","translation":"او که اکنون یک سرآشپز مشهور است، به ندرت از زندگی خود به عنوان یک آشپز ارتش صحبت می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800236.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sara admits to having affairs throughout her married life .","translation":"سارا اعتراف می کند که در طول زندگی زناشویی خود رابطه نامشروع داشته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800237.mp3"},{"sentence":"Most of his working life was spent in the shipyards.","translation":"بیشتر عمر کاری او در کارخانه های کشتی سازی سپری شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800241.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
('acd17a38-f4ab-5f1f-809f-9c80d7bd3a38','eb30eb00-6c8f-5f26-b926-4af2d6f6bf6c',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'social/personal/sex etc life','زندگی، عمر؛ حیات؛ دوران (شغل)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('18f3127c-3744-5747-829c-8e985b610bff','eb30eb00-6c8f-5f26-b926-4af2d6f6bf6c',6,'human existence','وجود انسان','spoken & written','human existence , considered as a variety of experiences and activities','[ uncountable ]',null,'وجود انسان، به عنوان انواع تجربیات و فعالیت ها در نظر گرفته می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"My Aunt Julia had very little experience of life.","translation":"خاله من جولیا تجربه بسیار کمی از زندگی داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001460723.mp3"},{"sentence":"Life has a way of changing the best of plans.","translation":"زندگی راهی برای تغییر بهترین برنامه ها دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001460724.mp3"},{"sentence":"For some people, religion gives life a meaning.","translation":"برای برخی افراد، دین به زندگی معنا می بخشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000944.mp3"},{"sentence":"the frustrations and disappointments of everyday life","translation":"ناامیدی ها و ناامیدی های زندگی روزمره","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800251.mp3"},{"sentence":"I try to see the funny side of life .","translation":"سعی می کنم جنبه خنده دار زندگی را ببینم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800252.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('886c0e3b-8fea-5c70-a68f-739eb0edcf61','eb30eb00-6c8f-5f26-b926-4af2d6f6bf6c',7,'time when something exists/works','زمانی که چیزی وجود دارد/کار می کند','spoken & written','the period of time during which something happens or exists','[ countable usually singular ]','shelf life','دوره زمانی که در طی آن چیزی اتفاق می افتد یا وجود دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The issues will not be resolved during the life of the present parliament.","translation":"در طول عمر مجلس حاضر مسائل حل نخواهد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001460828.mp3"},{"sentence":"The building began life as a monastery.","translation":"این ساختمان زندگی خود را به عنوان یک صومعه آغاز کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800259.mp3"},{"sentence":"What’s the average life of a passenger aircraft?","translation":"میانگین عمر یک هواپیمای مسافربری چقدر است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001460834.mp3"},{"sentence":"Careful use can extend the life of your washing machine.","translation":"استفاده دقیق می تواند عمر ماشین لباسشویی شما را افزایش دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800260.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('6712ab4e-2395-569e-b918-be1eefc5e305','eb30eb00-6c8f-5f26-b926-4af2d6f6bf6c',8,'living things','موجودات زنده','spoken & written','the quality of being alive that people, animals, plants etc have and that objects and dead things do not have','[ uncountable ]','wildlife','کیفیت زنده بودن که مردم، حیوانات، گیاهان و غیره دارند و اشیا و چیزهای مرده ندارند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Ben felt her neck for a pulse or any other sign of life .","translation":"بن گردن او را برای نبض یا هر نشانه دیگری از زندگی احساس کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000945.mp3"},{"sentence":"In the springtime, everything comes to life again.","translation":"در بهار همه چیز دوباره زنده می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001800269.mp3"},{"sentence":"Is there life on other planets?","translation":"آیا در سیارات دیگر حیات وجود دارد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000334880.mp3"},{"sentence":"The island is rich in bird life.","translation":"این جزیره سرشار از زندگی پرندگان است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001460801.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
