('a8b6223f-55fc-5d4a-9ee0-eedae2eb6002','54bc96e6-9f88-53c3-b407-ca6306b8ac92',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a set of names , numbers etc, usually written one below the other, for example so that you can remember or check them',null,null,'فهرست، لیس؛ لفظ (فهرست)؛ فهرست (منتظران)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make/draw up/write a list Could you make a list of any supplies we need?','compile a list formal (= write a list ) They’ve compiled a list of children’s clubs and organizations.','put somebody/something on a list I was put on a waiting list to see a specialist at the hospital.','top a list (= be the first thing in a list ) The novel topped the best-seller list.','at the top/bottom of a list Her name was at the top of the list of students.','first/last on a list Your name will be first on my list. Why am I always last on the list?','long/short He read out a long list of errors.','a complete/full/comprehensive list The full list of winners is on page seven.','a price list We’ll send you a catalog and price list.','a shopping list (= a list of things you want to buy ) a Christmas shopping list','a grocery list American English (= a list of food you want to buy ) Did you put milk on the grocery list?','a wine list (= a list of wines available in a restaurant ) a good wine list','a waiting list (= a list of people who are waiting for something ) If you don’t get the class you want, you can put your name on a waiting list.','a mailing list (= a list of people that a company sends information to ) If you do not want to be on our mailing list, please tick the box below.','a guest list (= a list of people invited somewhere ) the guest list for the wedding reception','a to-do list (= a list of things you must do ) Painting the bedroom is at the top of my to-do list.','a hit list (= a list of people, organizations etc that someone wants to harm or stop )']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Make a list of all the things you have to do.","translation":"فهرستی از تمام کارهایی که باید انجام دهید تهیه کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001502852.mp3"},{"sentence":"The first person on my list is Mrs Gilling.","translation":"اولین نفر در لیست من خانم گیلینگ است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001742291.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('f141523d-b3b0-59d2-8108-b8b16f3be8f0','54bc96e6-9f88-53c3-b407-ca6306b8ac92',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be high/low on a list (of something)','فهرست، لیس؛ لفظ (فهرست)؛ فهرست (منتظران)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make/draw up/write a list Could you make a list of any supplies we need?','compile a list formal (= write a list ) They’ve compiled a list of children’s clubs and organizations.','put somebody/something on a list I was put on a waiting list to see a specialist at the hospital.','top a list (= be the first thing in a list ) The novel topped the best-seller list.','at the top/bottom of a list Her name was at the top of the list of students.','first/last on a list Your name will be first on my list. Why am I always last on the list?','long/short He read out a long list of errors.','a complete/full/comprehensive list The full list of winners is on page seven.','a price list We’ll send you a catalog and price list.','a shopping list (= a list of things you want to buy ) a Christmas shopping list','a grocery list American English (= a list of food you want to buy ) Did you put milk on the grocery list?','a wine list (= a list of wines available in a restaurant ) a good wine list','a waiting list (= a list of people who are waiting for something ) If you don’t get the class you want, you can put your name on a waiting list.','a mailing list (= a list of people that a company sends information to ) If you do not want to be on our mailing list, please tick the box below.','a guest list (= a list of people invited somewhere ) the guest list for the wedding reception','a to-do list (= a list of things you must do ) Painting the bedroom is at the top of my to-do list.','a hit list (= a list of people, organizations etc that someone wants to harm or stop )']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('046af0db-857a-5f41-8add-8b8bf25c13bd','dd2e0ec3-f531-53b9-9b78-5cb05e57ab5d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to write a list, or mention things one after the other','[ transitive ]',null,'فهرست کردن؛ برشمردن (موارد)؛ درج کردن (در بورس)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The guidebook lists 1,000 hotels and restaurants.","translation":"این کتاب راهنما 1000 هتل و رستوران را فهرست کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001502891.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('05e4925f-9039-506c-9927-1703819f9181','dd2e0ec3-f531-53b9-9b78-5cb05e57ab5d',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to put someone on an official list, especially a hospital or court list','[ transitive ]',null,'قرار دادن کسی در لیست رسمی، به ویژه در لیست بیمارستان یا دادگاه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Several passengers were listed in critical condition.","translation":"حال تعدادی از مسافران وخیم گزارش شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001742310.mp3"},{"sentence":"The case was listed for trial in the Crown Court.","translation":"این پرونده برای محاکمه در دادگاه سلطنتی فهرست شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001742311.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('8b391955-abbb-55b0-9a15-e52fda029ce4','dd2e0ec3-f531-53b9-9b78-5cb05e57ab5d',3,null,null,'spoken & written','if a ship lists, it leans to one side','[ intransitive ]',null,'اگر کشتی لیست شود، به یک طرف خم می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('f775e9ea-b146-54d4-b32a-058167d3e5dd','a8030d7f-0f29-51d9-81bd-ad9ca17cfa29',1,'in a place/home','در یک مکان/خانه','spoken & written','if you live in a place, you have your home there','[ intransitive always + adverb/preposition ]',null,'زندگی کردن، سکونت داشتن (در)؛ زندگی کردن (بقا)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They lived in Holland for ten years.","translation":"آنها ده سال در هلند زندگی کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796264.mp3"},{"sentence":"He lives just across the street from me.","translation":"او درست روبروی من زندگی می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796265.mp3"},{"sentence":"We live only a few miles from the coast.","translation":"ما فقط چند مایلی از ساحل زندگی می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796266.mp3"},{"sentence":"A rather odd family came to live next door to us.","translation":"یک خانواده نسبتاً عجیب و غریب آمدند تا در همسایگی ما زندگی کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796267.mp3"},{"sentence":"As soon as I saw the place, I knew I didn’t want to live there .","translation":"به محض دیدن مکان، فهمیدم که نمی‌خواهم آنجا زندگی کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796271.mp3"},{"sentence":"Does Paul still live here ?","translation":"آیا پل هنوز اینجا زندگی می کند؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796275.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’re still looking for somewhere to live .","translation":"ما همچنان به دنبال جایی برای زندگی هستیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796279.mp3"},{"sentence":"They’ve finally found a place to live .","translation":"بالاخره جایی برای زندگی پیدا کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796283.mp3"},{"sentence":"My grandmother came to live with us when I was ten.","translation":"ده ساله بودم که مادربزرگم پیش ما زندگی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796289.mp3"},{"sentence":"Most seventeen-year-olds still live at home (= live with their parents ) .","translation":"بیشتر نوجوانان هفده ساله هنوز در خانه زندگی می کنند (= با والدین خود زندگی می کنند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796290.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m quite happy living alone .","translation":"من از تنها زندگی کردن کاملاً خوشحالم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796295.mp3"},{"sentence":"The house has 3,600 square feet of living space (= the areas of a house you live in ) .","translation":"این خانه دارای 3600 فوت مربع فضای نشیمن (= مساحت خانه ای است که در آن زندگی می کنید).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001834694.mp3"},{"sentence":"I ran away from home and lived rough for nine months.","translation":"من از خانه فرار کردم و نه ماه سخت زندگی کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020126.mp3"}]'::jsonb,13),
('ec77af89-8497-506b-9aae-e5f973754771','a8030d7f-0f29-51d9-81bd-ad9ca17cfa29',2,'plant/animal','گیاه/حیوان','spoken & written','a plant or animal that lives in a particular place grows there or has its home there','[ intransitive always + adverb/preposition ]',null,'گیاه یا حیوانی که در یک مکان خاص زندگی می کند در آنجا رشد می کند یا خانه خود را در آنجا دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"These particular birds live on only one island in the Pacific.","translation":"این پرندگان خاص تنها در یک جزیره در اقیانوس آرام زندگی می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796307.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('5b0b72a6-9929-5272-8070-9ce4ecb9b19d','a8030d7f-0f29-51d9-81bd-ad9ca17cfa29',3,'at a particular time','در یک زمان خاص','spoken & written','if you live at a particular time, you are alive then','[ intransitive always + adverb/preposition ]',null,'اگر در زمان خاصی زندگی می کنید، آن وقت زنده هستید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He lived in the eighteenth century.","translation":"او در قرن هجدهم زندگی می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796308.mp3"},{"sentence":"She lived at a time when women were not expected to work.","translation":"او در زمانی زندگی می کرد که از زنان انتظار کار نمی رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001504154.mp3"},{"sentence":"Gladstone lived during a period of great social change.","translation":"گلادستون در دوره ای از تغییرات اجتماعی بزرگ زندگی می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001504155.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s probably the best journalist who ever lived.","translation":"او احتمالا بهترین روزنامه نگاری است که تا به حال زندگی کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796312.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('eabfc0cb-5936-587a-858a-0cce7168c2f2','a8030d7f-0f29-51d9-81bd-ad9ca17cfa29',4,'be/stay alive','بودن/زنده ماندن','spoken & written','to be alive or be able to stay alive','[ intransitive ]',null,'زنده بودن یا توانایی زنده ماندن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Without light, plants couldn’t live.","translation":"بدون نور، گیاهان نمی توانند زندگی کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001504252.mp3"},{"sentence":"He is extremely ill and not expected to live.","translation":"او به شدت بیمار است و انتظار نمی رود که زنده بماند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001504253.mp3"},{"sentence":"The baby only lived a few hours.","translation":"نوزاد فقط چند ساعت زنده ماند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001504254.mp3"},{"sentence":"People on average are living much longer than before.","translation":"مردم به طور متوسط ​​بسیار طولانی تر از گذشته زندگی می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796313.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ll never forget this for as long as I live .","translation":"تا زمانی که زنده ام هرگز این را فراموش نمی کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796319.mp3"},{"sentence":"My grandmother lived to 85.","translation":"مادربزرگ من 85 سال عمر کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796325.mp3"},{"sentence":"She lived to the age of 79.","translation":"او تا 79 سالگی زندگی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796326.mp3"},{"sentence":"He knows he’s only got a few months to live.","translation":"او می داند که فقط چند ماه دیگر زنده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796329.mp3"},{"sentence":"He did not live to see (= live long enough to see ) the realization of his dream.","translation":"او زنده نشد تا تحقق رویای خود را ببیند (= آنقدر زنده بماند که ببیند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796330.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
('d6149df1-f90a-5b3b-ba34-71b7a5ce0337','a8030d7f-0f29-51d9-81bd-ad9ca17cfa29',5,'way of life','روش زندگی','spoken & written','to have a particular type of life, or live in a particular way','[ intransitive always + adverb/preposition, transitive ]',null,'داشتن نوع خاصی از زندگی، یا زندگی به شیوه ای خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The people in this country just want to live in peace.","translation":"مردم این کشور فقط می خواهند در صلح زندگی کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796338.mp3"},{"sentence":"People should not live in fear of crime.","translation":"مردم نباید در ترس از جنایت زندگی کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796339.mp3"},{"sentence":"We live in hope that a cure will be found.","translation":"ما به امید یافتن درمانی زندگی می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796340.mp3"},{"sentence":"The two communities live peacefully alongside each other.","translation":"این دو جامعه با آرامش در کنار یکدیگر زندگی می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796343.mp3"},{"sentence":"She thought that she would get married and live happily ever after (= like in a children’s story ) .","translation":"او فکر می کرد که ازدواج خواهد کرد و تا آخر عمر با خوشبختی زندگی خواهد کرد (= مانند داستان کودکانه).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796344.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some people like to live dangerously.","translation":"برخی افراد دوست دارند خطرناک زندگی کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796349.mp3"},{"sentence":"Most elderly people prefer to live independently if they can.","translation":"اکثر افراد مسن ترجیح می دهند اگر بتوانند مستقل زندگی کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796350.mp3"},{"sentence":"They earn enough money to live well (= have plenty of food, clothes etc ) .","translation":"آنها به اندازه کافی پول به دست می آورند تا خوب زندگی کنند (= غذا، لباس و غیره فراوان دارند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796351.mp3"},{"sentence":"I just want to live my life in my own way.","translation":"من فقط می خواهم زندگی خود را به روش خودم زندگی کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796356.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s not well enough to live a normal life .","translation":"او آنقدر خوب نیست که بتواند یک زندگی عادی داشته باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796362.mp3"},{"sentence":"She lives a very busy life.","translation":"او زندگی بسیار شلوغی دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001504180.mp3"},{"sentence":"He had chosen to live the life of a monk.","translation":"او زندگی یک راهب را انتخاب کرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796366.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’s now in Hollywood living a life of luxury .","translation":"او اکنون در هالیوود زندگی می کند و زندگی لوکسی دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796370.mp3"},{"sentence":"I have always tried to live by my faith (= according to my religion ) .","translation":"من همیشه سعی کرده ام با ایمانم (= بر اساس دینم) زندگی کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796376.mp3"},{"sentence":"We struggle on, living from day to day (= trying to find enough money each day to buy food etc ) .","translation":"ما در تلاش هستیم، روز به روز زندگی می کنیم (= تلاش برای یافتن پول کافی برای خرید غذا و غیره).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796380.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was tired of living out of a suitcase (= spending a lot of time travelling ) .","translation":"او از زندگی خارج از چمدان (= وقت زیادی برای سفر کردن) خسته شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796385.mp3"}]'::jsonb,16),
('d2dc0e36-4535-5b58-bbc1-c18efa73be93','a8030d7f-0f29-51d9-81bd-ad9ca17cfa29',6,'earn a living','کسب درآمد','spoken & written','the way that someone lives is the way that they earn money to buy food etc','[ intransitive ]',null,'روش زندگی یک نفر روشی است که برای خرید غذا و غیره پول بدست می آورد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Fishing is the way their families have lived for generations.","translation":"ماهیگیری روشی است که خانواده های آنها برای نسل ها زندگی کرده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796390.mp3"},{"sentence":"They live by hunting and killing deer.","translation":"آنها با شکار و کشتن آهو زندگی می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796393.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('52d24b9d-9017-5c24-90cd-ee6e9c1aa97a','a8030d7f-0f29-51d9-81bd-ad9ca17cfa29',7,'exciting life','زندگی هیجان انگیز','spoken & written','to have an exciting life','[ intransitive ]',null,'برای داشتن یک زندگی هیجان انگیز','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She wanted to get out and live a little.","translation":"او می خواست بیرون برود و کمی زندگی کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796394.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’re beginning to live at last!","translation":"ما بالاخره شروع به زندگی می کنیم!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001504245.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('d28082de-745d-52ac-9b48-a266b2d821bc','a8030d7f-0f29-51d9-81bd-ad9ca17cfa29',8,'imagine something','چیزی را تصور کن','spoken & written','to imagine that things are happening to you','[ intransitive always + adverb/preposition ]',null,'تصور کنید که چیزهایی برای شما اتفاق می افتد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He lives in a fantasy world.","translation":"او در دنیای فانتزی زندگی می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796397.mp3"},{"sentence":"She lived through her children’s lives.","translation":"او در طول زندگی فرزندانش زندگی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796400.mp3"},{"sentence":"You must stop living in the past (= imagining that things from the past are still happening ) .","translation":"شما باید زندگی در گذشته را متوقف کنید (= تصور کنید که چیزهای گذشته هنوز در حال وقوع هستند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796401.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('40c1b807-36b9-52f6-9538-48612ec627c8','a8030d7f-0f29-51d9-81bd-ad9ca17cfa29',9,'be kept somewhere','جایی نگهداری شود','informal','the place where something lives is the place where it is kept','[ intransitive always + adverb/preposition ]',null,'جایی که چیزی در آن زندگی می کند، جایی است که در آن نگهداری می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Where do these cups live?","translation":"این جام ها کجا زندگی می کنند؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796406.mp3"},{"sentence":"Those big dishes live in the cupboard next to the fridge.","translation":"آن ظروف بزرگ در کمد کنار یخچال زندگی می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796407.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('93302a28-5648-5046-95b2-ee85173f7baa','a8030d7f-0f29-51d9-81bd-ad9ca17cfa29',10,'still exist/have influence','هنوز وجود دارد/تاثیر دارد','spoken & written','if an idea lives, it continues to exist and influence people','[ intransitive ]',null,'اگر ایده ای زنده بماند، به وجود خود ادامه می دهد و بر مردم تأثیر می گذارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Democracy still lives!","translation":"دموکراسی هنوز زنده است!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001504331.mp3"},{"sentence":"His name will live forever .","translation":"نام او تا ابد زنده خواهد ماند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796408.mp3"},{"sentence":"That day will always live in my memory .","translation":"آن روز همیشه در خاطرم خواهد ماند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001796412.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
