('387629d4-ec35-5c56-bc1a-1aab245bd441','61865a89-02bf-51eb-a788-96f80d2ca0a3',1,'stop having attitude/quality etc','دست از نگرش/کیفیت و غیره بردارید','spoken & written','to stop having a particular attitude , quality, ability etc, or to gradually have less of it','[ transitive ]',null,'گم کردن؛ از دست دادن؛ بازنده شدن (بازی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ve lost my appetite.","translation":"من اشتهایم را از دست داده ام","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824624.mp3"},{"sentence":"The business community has lost confidence in the government.","translation":"جامعه تجاری اعتماد خود را به دولت از دست داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001739822.mp3"},{"sentence":"Carol lost interest in ballet in her teens.","translation":"کارول در نوجوانی علاقه خود را به باله از دست داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001739824.mp3"},{"sentence":"Try not to lose heart (= become sad and hopeless ) – there are plenty of other jobs.","translation":"سعی کنید دلتان را از دست ندهید (= غمگین و ناامید شوید) - کارهای دیگر نیز زیاد است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001739836.mp3"},{"sentence":"A settlement was reached in which neither side lost face.","translation":"توافقی حاصل شد که در آن هیچ یک از طرفین چهره خود را از دست ندادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824630.mp3"},{"sentence":"You’re looking slim. Have you lost weight?","translation":"شما لاغر به نظر می رسید آیا وزن کم کرده اید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824633.mp3"},{"sentence":"The plane emptied its fuel tanks as it started losing altitude.","translation":"هواپیما با شروع به از دست دادن ارتفاع، مخازن سوخت خود را خالی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824634.mp3"},{"sentence":"Mr Eyer may lose the sight in one eye.","translation":"آقای ایر ممکن است بینایی یک چشم خود را از دست بدهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824637.mp3"},{"sentence":"The tour was postponed when the lead singer lost his voice.","translation":"این تور با از دست دادن صدای خواننده اصلی به تعویق افتاد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824638.mp3"},{"sentence":"Julian lost his balance and fell.","translation":"جولیان تعادل خود را از دست داد و افتاد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824639.mp3"},{"sentence":"This latest movie proves Altman is by no means losing his touch.","translation":"این آخرین فیلم ثابت می کند که آلتمن به هیچ وجه ارتباط خود را از دست نمی دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824643.mp3"},{"sentence":"By the time the ambulance arrived, Douglas had lost consciousness .","translation":"در زمان رسیدن آمبولانس، داگلاس از هوش رفته بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824644.mp3"},{"sentence":"When he was writing, he lost all sense of time.","translation":"وقتی داشت می نوشت تمام حس زمان را از دست داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824650.mp3"},{"sentence":"We must never lose sight of the fact that man must work in harmony with nature.","translation":"ما هرگز نباید از این واقعیت غافل شویم که انسان باید هماهنگ با طبیعت کار کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824654.mp3"}]'::jsonb,14),
('adc742c0-69bb-5a82-8873-dd00ae2698d0','61865a89-02bf-51eb-a788-96f80d2ca0a3',2,'not win','برنده نیست','spoken & written','to not win a game, argument , election , war etc','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'برنده نشدن در یک بازی، بحث، انتخابات، جنگ و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They played so badly they deserved to lose.","translation":"آنها آنقدر بد بازی کردند که مستحق شکست بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001739851.mp3"},{"sentence":"Klinger lost his seat in the election.","translation":"کلینگر کرسی خود را در انتخابات از دست داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824660.mp3"},{"sentence":"Arkansas just lost three games in a row.","translation":"آرکانزاس سه بازی متوالی را باخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824661.mp3"},{"sentence":"He just can’t bear to lose an argument.","translation":"او فقط تحمل از دست دادن یک بحث را ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824662.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Beavers have dropped only one game since losing to Oregon in January.","translation":"بیورز از زمان باخت به اورگان در ژانویه تنها یک بازی را واگذار کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001739856.mp3"},{"sentence":"The government lost by one vote.","translation":"دولت با یک رای شکست خورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001516965.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Communist candidate lost by a whisker (= a very small amount ) .","translation":"نامزد کمونیست با یک سبیل (= مقدار بسیار کمی) شکست خورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001739852.mp3"},{"sentence":"Freddie died in 1982 after losing his battle against AIDS.","translation":"فردی در سال 1982 پس از شکست در مبارزه با ایدز درگذشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001739853.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was a rash decision, and it lost him the race (= caused him to lose the race ) .","translation":"این یک تصمیم عجولانه بود و مسابقه را از دست داد (= باعث شد او مسابقه را از دست بدهد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824674.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
('7c37011f-624d-53af-9346-e1ae8fa31bff','61865a89-02bf-51eb-a788-96f80d2ca0a3',3,'cannot find something','نمی تواند چیزی را پیدا کند','spoken & written','to become unable to find someone or something','[ transitive ]','lost property','ناتوان شدن در یافتن کسی یا چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ve lost the tickets for tonight’s show.","translation":"بلیت های نمایش امشب را گم کرده ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001739849.mp3"},{"sentence":"I followed her on foot, but lost her in the crowd.","translation":"پیاده به دنبالش رفتم اما او را در میان جمعیت گم کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824679.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was thought the manuscript had been lost forever .","translation":"تصور می شد که این دست نوشته برای همیشه گم شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001516982.mp3"},{"sentence":"The parcel must have got lost in the post.","translation":"بسته باید در پست گم شده باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824688.mp3"},{"sentence":"He lost track of her after her family moved away.","translation":"پس از اینکه خانواده اش از آنجا دور شدند، رد او را گم کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824695.mp3"},{"sentence":"Don’t try to walk in a heavy snowstorm as you may lose sight of your vehicle.","translation":"سعی نکنید در طوفان شدید برف راه بروید زیرا ممکن است دید وسیله نقلیه خود را از دست بدهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824699.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('3fab8b8e-ac7b-5605-8dc7-dac44ecb9a75','61865a89-02bf-51eb-a788-96f80d2ca0a3',4,'stop having something','دست از داشتن چیزی بردارید','spoken & written','if you lose something that is important or necessary , you then no longer have it, especially because it has been taken from you or destroyed','[ transitive ]',null,'اگر چیزی را که مهم یا ضروری است از دست بدهید، دیگر آن را ندارید، به خصوص به این دلیل که از شما گرفته شده یا از بین رفته است.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"David’s very upset about losing his job .","translation":"دیوید از از دست دادن شغلش بسیار ناراحت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001739841.mp3"},{"sentence":"Hundreds of people lost their homes in the floods.","translation":"صدها نفر در سیل خانه های خود را از دست دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001739842.mp3"},{"sentence":"My family lost everything in the war.","translation":"خانواده ام در جنگ همه چیز را از دست دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001739843.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was over the limit and will lose his licence .","translation":"او بیش از حد مجاز بود و گواهینامه خود را از دست خواهد داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824715.mp3"},{"sentence":"Ninety naval aircraft were lost and thirty damaged.","translation":"90 فروند هواپیمای دریایی گم و 30 فروند آسیب دید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00561.mp3"},{"sentence":"If you hesitate, you may lose the opportunity to compete altogether.","translation":"اگر تردید کنید، ممکن است فرصت رقابت را به طور کلی از دست بدهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824724.mp3"},{"sentence":"We were losing customers to cheaper rivals.","translation":"در حال از دست دادن مشتریان به رقبای ارزان‌تر بودیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824727.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was about to lose her husband to a younger woman.","translation":"نزدیک بود شوهرش را به خاطر یک زن جوانتر از دست بدهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824728.mp3"},{"sentence":"California has lost 90% of its wetlands to development.","translation":"کالیفرنیا 90 درصد از تالاب های خود را به دلیل توسعه از دست داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824729.mp3"},{"sentence":"He lost his leg in a motorcycle accident.","translation":"او در تصادف با موتورسیکلت پای خود را از دست داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824732.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s lost a lot of blood but his life is not in danger.","translation":"او خون زیادی از دست داده اما جانش در خطر نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824733.mp3"},{"sentence":"the mistakes which lost him his kingdom (= caused him to lose his kingdom )","translation":"خطاهایی که پادشاهی او را از دست داد (= باعث شد سلطنتش را از دست بدهد)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824739.mp3"}]'::jsonb,12),
('d42b144d-710b-5721-86c9-c166fcbefb10','61865a89-02bf-51eb-a788-96f80d2ca0a3',5,'death','مرگ','spoken & written','to die','[ transitive ]',null,'برای مردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a memorial to honor those who lost their lives in the war","translation":"یادبودی برای تجلیل از کسانی که جان خود را در جنگ از دست دادند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824746.mp3"},{"sentence":"One woman in Brooklyn lost a husband and two sons in the gang wars.","translation":"یک زن در بروکلین یک شوهر و دو پسرش را در جنگ های باند از دست داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824749.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sadly, Anna lost the baby (= her baby died before it was born ) .","translation":"متأسفانه آنا نوزاد را از دست داد (= نوزادش قبل از تولد فوت کرد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001739879.mp3"},{"sentence":"He lost his father to cancer (= his father died of cancer ) last year.","translation":"او پدرش را به دلیل سرطان از دست داد (= پدرش بر اثر سرطان درگذشت).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824752.mp3"},{"sentence":"Peter was lost at sea when his ship sank.","translation":"با غرق شدن کشتی پیتر در دریا گم شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824756.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('2cdea419-fa5c-5641-b545-1fc74618c4e4','61865a89-02bf-51eb-a788-96f80d2ca0a3',6,'money','پول','spoken & written','if you lose money, you then have less money than you had before','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'اگر پول از دست بدهید، پس از آن پول کمتری نسبت به قبل دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The company is in debt after losing an estimated $30 million on its dotcom enterprise.","translation":"این شرکت پس از از دست دادن حدود 30 میلیون دلار در شرکت دات کام خود بدهکار است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001739863.mp3"},{"sentence":"Creditors and investors stand to lose (= risk losing ) vast sums after the company’s collapse.","translation":"اعتبار دهندگان و سرمایه گذاران پس از فروپاشی شرکت مبالغ هنگفتی را از دست خواهند داد (= خطر از دست دادن).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824764.mp3"},{"sentence":"A lot of people lost their shirts (= lost a lot of money ) on Ferraris in the eighties.","translation":"بسیاری از مردم پیراهن های خود را گم کردند (= پول زیادی از دست دادند) در فراری در دهه هشتاد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824769.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s a great deal – we can’t lose!","translation":"این یک معامله عالی است - ما نمی توانیم ببازیم!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824776.mp3"},{"sentence":"The stock market crash lost the banks £70 million (= caused them to lose £70 million ) .","translation":"سقوط بازار سهام 70 میلیون پوند بانک ها را از دست داد (= باعث زیان 70 میلیون پوندی آنها شد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824779.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
