('3303bbe8-346f-5c12-a7e7-1c4cb478fb7c','62b5657a-4853-59e0-ab75-0f3e5eb53eeb',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a list of all the kinds of food that are available for a meal , especially in a restaurant',null,null,'منو، فهرست غذا؛ منو (رایانه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['read/study the menu Sandy read the menu, but didn’t see anything he wanted to eat.','look at/see the menu (= read the menu ) He looked at the menu and decided to have the salad.','plan a menu (= decide what foods will be served ) Erika began planning a menu for the dinner party.','choose/order something from the menu He ordered a chicken dish from the menu.','offer a menu The restaurant is offering a three-course menu for New Year’s Eve.','have a good/long/unusual etc menu The new restaurant on Fifth Street has an excellent menu.','extensive (= with many different dishes on it ) The menu is extensive and adventurous.','a dinner/lunch/breakfast menu There is an extensive dinner menu, and seafood is a speciality.','a set/fixed menu (= when the cook decides which dishes will be served to you, rather than you choosing for yourself ) Dinner is three courses from a set menu.','an à la carte menu (= a menu listing many separate dishes which you choose from ) In the evening there is a full à la carte menu.','a children’s menu I asked the waiter if there was a children’s menu.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Could we have the menu, please?","translation":"میشه منو داشته باشیم لطفا؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000222837.mp3"},{"sentence":"Is there any fish on the menu?","translation":"آیا ماهی در منو وجود دارد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000222836.mp3"},{"sentence":"a three-course set menu (= dishes which you do not choose for yourself )","translation":"منوی سه وعده غذایی (= غذاهایی که خودتان انتخاب نمی کنید)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00588.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('f2d4977a-ac5b-5c62-ad06-fd70346aa21b','62b5657a-4853-59e0-ab75-0f3e5eb53eeb',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a list of things on a computer screen which you can ask the computer to do',null,null,'لیستی از چیزهایی که روی صفحه نمایش کامپیوتر وجود دارد که می توانید از کامپیوتر بخواهید آنها را انجام دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['read/study the menu Sandy read the menu, but didn’t see anything he wanted to eat.','look at/see the menu (= read the menu ) He looked at the menu and decided to have the salad.','plan a menu (= decide what foods will be served ) Erika began planning a menu for the dinner party.','choose/order something from the menu He ordered a chicken dish from the menu.','offer a menu The restaurant is offering a three-course menu for New Year’s Eve.','have a good/long/unusual etc menu The new restaurant on Fifth Street has an excellent menu.','extensive (= with many different dishes on it ) The menu is extensive and adventurous.','a dinner/lunch/breakfast menu There is an extensive dinner menu, and seafood is a speciality.','a set/fixed menu (= when the cook decides which dishes will be served to you, rather than you choosing for yourself ) Dinner is three courses from a set menu.','an à la carte menu (= a menu listing many separate dishes which you choose from ) In the evening there is a full à la carte menu.','a children’s menu I asked the waiter if there was a children’s menu.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Select PRINT from the main menu.","translation":"PRINT را از منوی اصلی انتخاب کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564288.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('839b39c5-157b-5b47-acaa-c4460a7f735d','5c28c31c-c4bd-592d-80b6-1fae6a01497a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to emphasize how small or unimportant something or someone is',null,null,'صرفاً ...، فقط (تأکید بر کمبود)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She lost the election by a mere 20 votes.","translation":"او در انتخابات تنها با 20 رای شکست خورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000223236.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s a mere child.","translation":"او یک کودک محض است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000223237.mp3"},{"sentence":"It can’t be a mere coincidence that they left at the same time.","translation":"این نمی تواند صرفاً تصادفی باشد که آنها همزمان رفتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564337.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b5c4b63e-926c-5720-bd26-de5102ced17e','5c28c31c-c4bd-592d-80b6-1fae6a01497a',2,null,null,'spoken & written','used to emphasize that something which is small or not extreme has a big effect or is important',null,null,'برای تأکید بر این که چیزی کوچک یا غیر افراطی تأثیر زیادی دارد یا مهم است استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The merest little noise makes him nervous.","translation":"صدای کوچک او را عصبی می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000223244.mp3"},{"sentence":"The mere thought of food made her feel sick.","translation":"فکر صرف غذا باعث می شد که او احساس بیماری کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564344.mp3"},{"sentence":"The mere fact that the talks are continuing is a positive sign.","translation":"صرف این واقعیت که مذاکرات ادامه دارد نشانه مثبتی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564341.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
