('a7cb5942-29f4-5c38-926e-f7bafb0e5909','c71500a8-63d6-5894-8d8f-b03a2a06ddb5',1,'dirty/untidy','کثیف / نامرتب','spoken & written','if there is a mess somewhere or a place is a mess, things there are dirty or not neatly arranged','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'بهم‌ریختگی، شلوغی؛ وضعیت نامناسب؛ مواد باقی‌مانده','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"What a mess!","translation":"چه آشفتگی!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564437.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sorry – the place is a bit of a mess .","translation":"با عرض پوزش - مکان کمی آشفته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001648637.mp3"},{"sentence":"When I got home, the house was a complete mess .","translation":"وقتی به خانه رسیدم، خانه کاملاً به هم ریخته بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001974175.mp3"},{"sentence":"The burglars left the house in an awful mess.","translation":"سارقان به طرز وحشتناکی خانه را ترک کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564440.mp3"},{"sentence":"You can make cookies if you promise not to make a mess in the kitchen.","translation":"اگر قول بدهید که در آشپزخانه آشفتگی ایجاد نکنید، می توانید کوکی درست کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564447.mp3"},{"sentence":"Whoever is responsible for this mess can clear it up immediately!","translation":"هر کس مسئول این آشفتگی است می تواند بلافاصله آن را پاک کند!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564453.mp3"},{"sentence":"She hates mess.","translation":"او از آشفتگی متنفر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001974179.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('951d45db-92f4-5aeb-a47d-e590c84643ca','c71500a8-63d6-5894-8d8f-b03a2a06ddb5',2,'problems/difficulties','مشکلات/مشکلات','spoken & written','a situation in which there are a lot of problems and difficulties , especially as a result of mistakes or carelessness','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'شرایطی که در آن مشکلات و سختی های زیادی به خصوص در اثر اشتباه یا بی احتیاطی وجود دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"My life’s such a mess .","translation":"زندگی من اینقدر آشفته است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000223661.mp3"},{"sentence":"The economy is in a terrible mess.","translation":"اقتصاد در یک آشفتگی وحشتناک است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564454.mp3"},{"sentence":"You got us into this mess , Terry. You can get us out of it.","translation":"تو ما را وارد این آشفتگی کردی، تری. شما می توانید ما را از آن خارج کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564458.mp3"},{"sentence":"All she could do was pray that, somehow, she might be able to sort out the mess she had got herself into.","translation":"تنها کاری که می‌توانست بکند این بود که دعا کند تا به نحوی بتواند اوضاع آشفته‌ای را که به آن دچار شده بود، حل کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564466.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
