('739d23e2-c8ff-556e-8ceb-64544763638d','c184b9a6-5921-5b8f-ac7d-950519b6bad6',1,'decision/action','تصمیم / اقدام','spoken & written','something that you decide to do in order to achieve something',null,null,'اقدام، گام؛ حرکت (شطرنج)؛ جابجایی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a move We made the move mainly for financial reasons.','make no move The government made no move to hold the promised elections.','welcome the move Environmentalists welcomed the move to limit the length of fishing nets.','oppose a move Union members have opposed the move.','support a move The move was supported by the government.','a move is aimed at doing something/is designed to do something The move is aimed at strengthening its business in the region.','an important move I cannot decide on such an important move on my own.','a bold/daring move (= taking a lot of courage ) The writers made a bold move by killing off the main character.','a good/smart/wise move (= sensible ) I’m not sure it was a good move giving him the job.','the right move He hoped he had made the right move in telling his father.','an unprecedented move (= never having happened before ) Barcelona began the unprecedented move of shipping in drinking water.','somebody’s next move (= the next thing someone does ) What should happen next? What’s our next move?','a bad move It was a bad move letting him come here in the first place.','a false/wrong move (= made by mistake ) One wrong move and the business might never recover.','the first move She waited for Michael to make the first move.','a career move (= a decision that will improve the type of job you can do ) It looked like a good career move, with the possibility of promotion later.','there are moves afoot to do something British English (= there are plans, especially secret ones, to do something ) There are moves afoot to change things.','a move in the right direction The decision seemed to be a move in the right direction.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She’s still thinking about her next move .","translation":"او هنوز به حرکت بعدی خود فکر می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000193928.mp3"},{"sentence":"the Board’s recent moves to cut interest rates","translation":"اقدامات اخیر هیئت مدیره برای کاهش نرخ بهره","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001555434.mp3"},{"sentence":"Most of the council members are reluctant to make such a drastic move .","translation":"اکثر اعضای شورا تمایلی به انجام چنین حرکت شدیدی ندارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001555435.mp3"},{"sentence":"The authorities have made no move to resolve the conflict.","translation":"مقامات هیچ اقدامی برای حل مناقشه انجام نداده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001764160.mp3"},{"sentence":"She decided to learn as much about it as she could, which seemed like a wise move.","translation":"او تصمیم گرفت تا جایی که می تواند در مورد آن بیاموزد، که به نظر حرکت عاقلانه ای بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000193931.mp3"},{"sentence":"Taking the position was a good career move (= a decision that will improve the type of jobs you can do ) .","translation":"گرفتن این موقعیت یک حرکت شغلی خوب بود (= تصمیمی که نوع مشاغلی را که می توانید انجام دهید بهبود می بخشد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001555441.mp3"},{"sentence":"It seems there could be moves afoot to close the centre.","translation":"به نظر می رسد ممکن است اقداماتی برای بستن مرکز انجام شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001817529.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('b7a0b2ea-2953-571d-9de1-f7d323b55e35','c184b9a6-5921-5b8f-ac7d-950519b6bad6',2,'movement','حرکت','spoken & written','when someone moves for a short time in a particular direction','[ usually singular ]',null,'زمانی که شخصی برای مدت کوتاهی در جهت خاصی حرکت می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Good gymnasts rehearse their moves mentally before a competition.","translation":"ژیمناست های خوب قبل از مسابقه حرکات ذهنی خود را تمرین می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001555450.mp3"},{"sentence":"He made no move to come any nearer.","translation":"هیچ حرکتی برای نزدیک شدن نکرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001555451.mp3"},{"sentence":"Martin made a move towards the door.","translation":"مارتین به سمت در حرکت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001555455.mp3"},{"sentence":"His green eyes followed Cissy’s every move.","translation":"چشمان سبز او هر حرکت سیسی را دنبال می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001555461.mp3"},{"sentence":"One false move (= move in the wrong direction ) and I’ll shoot.","translation":"یک حرکت نادرست (= حرکت در جهت اشتباه) و من شلیک خواهم کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001555462.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
