('9f28f459-7200-5a93-9188-ef5b963f6af4','13190feb-9d16-57eb-a200-065ce0113865',12,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'who needs it/them?','نیاز داشتن، محتاج بودن (به)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('e56b149b-5311-5691-a02f-792f4eb9d276','58063c55-4c82-50ec-8bdb-e5e29b19f69d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a situation in which something is necessary, especially something that is not happening yet or is not yet available','[ singular ]',null,'نیاز، احتیاج؛ ضرورت؛ فقر (نیاز)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a real/clear need (= one that really exists ) There is a real need for after-school care in our area.','an urgent need (= one that must be dealt with quickly ) The most urgent need was for more teachers.','a pressing/crying need (= a very urgent need ) There’s a crying need for more doctors and nurses.','a desperate need (= an extremely urgent need ) There is a desperate need to build more housing.','a growing/increasing need She emphasized the growing need to deal with environmental problems.','stress/emphasize/underline the need for something (= say how important it is ) He stressed the need for better training courses.','eliminate the need for something ( also obviate the need for something formal ) (= make something unnecessary ) The new drug treatment eliminates the need for surgery.','a need exists New teaching materials must be created if a need exists for them.','there is a need for something Clearly there is a need for more research.','there is no need for something They felt that there was no need for a formal contract.','as/if/when the need arises (= if or when something becomes necessary ) Team members move from job to job as the need arises.','if need be (= if it is necessary ) I can work during my lunch break if need be.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There’s a growing need for new housing in many rural areas.","translation":"نیاز روزافزون به مسکن جدید در بسیاری از مناطق روستایی وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000237567.mp3"},{"sentence":"We fully recognize the need to improve communications.","translation":"ما به طور کامل نیاز به بهبود ارتباطات را درک می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001762528.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('59082421-e944-5e08-92e1-f0fde23a3118','58063c55-4c82-50ec-8bdb-e5e29b19f69d',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a strong feeling that you want something, want to do something, or that you must have something','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'احساس قوی این است که شما چیزی را می خواهید، می خواهید کاری انجام دهید یا اینکه باید چیزی داشته باشید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a real/clear need (= one that really exists ) There is a real need for after-school care in our area.','an urgent need (= one that must be dealt with quickly ) The most urgent need was for more teachers.','a pressing/crying need (= a very urgent need ) There’s a crying need for more doctors and nurses.','a desperate need (= an extremely urgent need ) There is a desperate need to build more housing.','a growing/increasing need She emphasized the growing need to deal with environmental problems.','stress/emphasize/underline the need for something (= say how important it is ) He stressed the need for better training courses.','eliminate the need for something ( also obviate the need for something formal ) (= make something unnecessary ) The new drug treatment eliminates the need for surgery.','a need exists New teaching materials must be created if a need exists for them.','there is a need for something Clearly there is a need for more research.','there is no need for something They felt that there was no need for a formal contract.','as/if/when the need arises (= if or when something becomes necessary ) Team members move from job to job as the need arises.','if need be (= if it is necessary ) I can work during my lunch break if need be.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the need for job satisfaction","translation":"نیاز به رضایت شغلی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001088.mp3"},{"sentence":"Jack did not feel the need to boast about his success.","translation":"جک نیازی به لاف زدن در مورد موفقیت خود احساس نمی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001990166.mp3"},{"sentence":"You’re welcome to come back and talk any time, if ever you feel the need.","translation":"هر زمان که احساس نیاز کردید، می توانید برگردید و صحبت کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001990167.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('a6457530-4243-56c9-983c-75a6bdf21b5a','58063c55-4c82-50ec-8bdb-e5e29b19f69d',3,null,null,'spoken & written','what someone needs to have in order to live a normal healthy comfortable life','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'آنچه که یک فرد برای داشتن یک زندگی راحت سالم و عادی باید داشته باشد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a real/clear need (= one that really exists ) There is a real need for after-school care in our area.','an urgent need (= one that must be dealt with quickly ) The most urgent need was for more teachers.','a pressing/crying need (= a very urgent need ) There’s a crying need for more doctors and nurses.','a desperate need (= an extremely urgent need ) There is a desperate need to build more housing.','a growing/increasing need She emphasized the growing need to deal with environmental problems.','stress/emphasize/underline the need for something (= say how important it is ) He stressed the need for better training courses.','eliminate the need for something ( also obviate the need for something formal ) (= make something unnecessary ) The new drug treatment eliminates the need for surgery.','a need exists New teaching materials must be created if a need exists for them.','there is a need for something Clearly there is a need for more research.','there is no need for something They felt that there was no need for a formal contract.','as/if/when the need arises (= if or when something becomes necessary ) Team members move from job to job as the need arises.','if need be (= if it is necessary ) I can work during my lunch break if need be.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She works to provide for her family’s basic needs .","translation":"او برای تامین نیازهای اولیه خانواده اش کار می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001567436.mp3"},{"sentence":"Environmentalists argue that the organization fails to address the needs of third world farmers.","translation":"محیط بانان استدلال می کنند که این سازمان نمی تواند به نیازهای کشاورزان جهان سوم رسیدگی کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001762543.mp3"},{"sentence":"The charity exists to meet the needs of elderly people.","translation":"این موسسه خیریه برای رفع نیازهای سالمندان وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000237621.mp3"},{"sentence":"Schools must satisfy the needs of their pupils.","translation":"مدارس باید نیازهای دانش آموزان خود را برآورده کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001567446.mp3"},{"sentence":"We have loans to meet your every need .","translation":"ما برای رفع هر نیاز شما وام داریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000237624.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('dcb6d91d-64da-5511-8d58-86341adaed8a','58063c55-4c82-50ec-8bdb-e5e29b19f69d',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'there’s no need (for somebody) to do something','نیاز، احتیاج؛ ضرورت؛ فقر (نیاز)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a real/clear need (= one that really exists ) There is a real need for after-school care in our area.','an urgent need (= one that must be dealt with quickly ) The most urgent need was for more teachers.','a pressing/crying need (= a very urgent need ) There’s a crying need for more doctors and nurses.','a desperate need (= an extremely urgent need ) There is a desperate need to build more housing.','a growing/increasing need She emphasized the growing need to deal with environmental problems.','stress/emphasize/underline the need for something (= say how important it is ) He stressed the need for better training courses.','eliminate the need for something ( also obviate the need for something formal ) (= make something unnecessary ) The new drug treatment eliminates the need for surgery.','a need exists New teaching materials must be created if a need exists for them.','there is a need for something Clearly there is a need for more research.','there is no need for something They felt that there was no need for a formal contract.','as/if/when the need arises (= if or when something becomes necessary ) Team members move from job to job as the need arises.','if need be (= if it is necessary ) I can work during my lunch break if need be.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
