d and bad news ) The good news is that most stores have the game in stock; the bad news is that it’s not cheap.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('881988b7-62a2-5695-893b-72a13aace6d2','2690e6a6-7f06-5a64-b8d3-a788fcba5f04',9,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'no news is good news','خبر، اخبار؛ خبر (خوب)؛ پخش (خبر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['good news He’s feeling much better, so that’s good news.','great/wonderful news They’re getting married? That’s wonderful news!','welcome news (= good news that makes you happy ) The lower interest rates will be welcome news to home owners.','bad/terrible news ‘I’m afraid I have bad news, ’ said Jackson. Have you heard the terrible news about Simon?','the latest news Mom sent a letter with all the latest news.','old news (= news that you have already heard ) She wasn’t surprised; it was old news to her.','important news I’ve got some important news to tell you.','the big news informal (= an important piece of news ) The big news is that Polly and Richard are going to get married.','have some news (for somebody) I could tell by his face that he had some news.','tell somebody the news Jack called him to tell him the good news.','break the news (to somebody) (= tell someone some bad news ) Two policemen came to the door to break the news about her husband.','spread the news (= tell a lot of people the news ) After she had the baby, her husband made phone calls to spread the happy news.','hear the news (= hear about something that has happened ) She was really upset when she heard the news.','welcome the news formal (= say that you are pleased about some news ) Environmental groups welcomed the news that the area would be protected.','greet the news with surprise/delight etc formal (= react to the news in a particular way ) Fans greeted the news of the victory with a loud cheer.','news spreads (= a lot of people find out the news from other people ) News spreads fast in a small town.','a piece of news ( also a bit of news British English ) Leo thought about this piece of news carefully.','the good news is …/the bad news is ... (= used to introduce a piece of good and bad news ) The good news is that most stores have the game in stock; the bad news is that it’s not cheap.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('cafa8871-9e64-56df-9022-f85ceb9d82cb','2da5d20e-1526-5b81-bf53-e4c5a8f22749',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the next event , day, time etc is the one that happens after the present one, or the previous one',null,null,'بعدی، آینده (هفته)؛ کنارِ (مکان)؛ بعدی (نوبت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I just missed my flight to Chicago. When’s the next one?","translation":"من همین الان پروازم به شیکاگو را از دست دادم. بعدی کی هست؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001556615.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’ll look at the proposals at the next meeting.","translation":"در جلسه بعدی پیشنهادات را بررسی خواهیم کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001556616.mp3"},{"sentence":"Over the next couple of months, try to relax more and get more exercise.","translation":"در طول چند ماه آینده، سعی کنید بیشتر آرام باشید و بیشتر ورزش کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001556617.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’re hoping to open the factory sometime next year.","translation":"ما امیدواریم که در سال آینده کارخانه را افتتاح کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00617.mp3"},{"sentence":"She called me and we arranged to meet the next day.","translation":"او به من زنگ زد و قرار گذاشتیم فردا همدیگر را ببینیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000241374.mp3"},{"sentence":"Next time I go skiing, I’ll wear warmer clothes.","translation":"دفعه بعد که به اسکی بروم، لباس های گرم تری می پوشم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000241377.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('a64a1860-5f8e-5294-9ab7-2af682e44534','2da5d20e-1526-5b81-bf53-e4c5a8f22749',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the next house, room, place etc is the one that is nearest to where you are now',null,'next to','خانه، اتاق، مکان و غیره بعدی خانه ای است که به جایی که اکنون هستید نزدیک است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Turn left at the next corner.","translation":"در گوشه بعدی به چپ بپیچید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000241356.mp3"},{"sentence":"We could hear them arguing in the next room.","translation":"در اتاق بغلی می توانستیم صدای دعوایشان را بشنویم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000241357.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('6608f4fb-bfc9-525a-9b60-6c9b1f7ff4d8','2da5d20e-1526-5b81-bf53-e4c5a8f22749',3,null,null,'spoken & written','the next person or thing in a list , series etc comes after the one that you are dealing with now',null,null,'شخص یا چیز بعدی در یک لیست، سریال و غیره بعد از چیزی است که شما اکنون با آن سروکار دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Read the next two chapters before Friday.","translation":"دو فصل بعدی را قبل از جمعه بخوانید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000241387.mp3"},{"sentence":"Do they have the next size up (= a slightly bigger size ) ?","translation":"آیا آنها سایز بعدی را دارند (= اندازه کمی بزرگتر)؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001556624.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
