('df1d9db0-cec2-53e4-a21f-5ed919da1796','0842194e-3a85-5f55-9bb4-df3fe23ed408',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if a vehicle , boat etc noses forward , or if you nose it forward, it moves forward slowly','[ intransitive, transitive always + adverb/preposition ]',null,'اگر یک وسیله نقلیه، قایق و غیره به سمت جلو حرکت کند، یا اگر آن را به سمت جلو بچرخانید، به آرامی به جلو حرکت می کند',array['edge']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The bus nosed its way along the street.","translation":"اتوبوس در امتداد خیابان پیچید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667672.mp3"},{"sentence":"She carefully nosed the car forward through the traffic.","translation":"او با احتیاط ماشین را به سمت جلو در میان ترافیک حرکت داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667678.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('70dc0389-5d6a-51a6-8b14-236e63c04556','fcb266bb-85b1-5eec-a450-1559046dad4f',1,'to remind you','برای یادآوری شما','spoken & written','something that you write down to remind you of something','[ countable ]',null,'یادداشت؛ سند (بانکی)؛ نوت (موسیقی)؛ حاشیه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Dave made a note of her address and phone number.","translation":"دیو آدرس و شماره تلفن خود را یادداشت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000251094.mp3"},{"sentence":"Keep a careful note of any problems you have with the software.","translation":"مشکلاتی را که با نرم افزار دارید به دقت یادداشت کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667872.mp3"},{"sentence":"He made a mental note to arrange a time to meet her.","translation":"او یک یادداشت ذهنی برای تعیین زمانی برای ملاقات با او نوشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667880.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('cffdcc8c-3750-5f97-b8c5-09395eb548cf','fcb266bb-85b1-5eec-a450-1559046dad4f',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'notes','یادداشت؛ سند (بانکی)؛ نوت (موسیقی)؛ حاشیه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make notes (= write them down ) As he read the letters, he made careful notes.','take notes (= write them down ) The reporter took notes throughout the interview.','jot down/scribble notes (= write them down quickly ) The jurors were scribbling notes as the witness gave evidence.','write up notes (= write down what your notes say, using full sentences and more detail ) It’s a good idea to write up your notes soon after a lecture.','look/go/read through your notes I read through my notes before the exam.','detailed notes I always make quite detailed notes after important meetings.','copious notes (= a very large amount ) She sat at the back of the hall and made copious notes.','brief notes (= short and not detailed ) He jotted down some brief notes.','scrappy notes (= very short and not detailed enough ) Her rather scrappy notes weren’t much use when it came to revision.','lecture notes (= notes that a student writes down during a lecture ) I missed class today; can I borrow your lecture notes?','case notes (= notes that a doctor, social worker etc makes about someone ) The researchers looked at the case notes of 500 patients with this type of cancer.','medical notes (= notes that a doctor keeps about a patient ) I asked if I could see my medical notes.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('34ffff50-2412-5d3c-b7b0-4e511e660db2','fcb266bb-85b1-5eec-a450-1559046dad4f',3,'short letter','نامه کوتاه','spoken & written','a short informal letter','[ countable ]',null,'یک نامه غیر رسمی کوتاه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I was going to write Kathy a note , but I decided to call her instead.","translation":"می خواستم یادداشتی برای کتی بنویسم، اما تصمیم گرفتم در عوض با او تماس بگیرم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000251100.mp3"},{"sentence":"This is just a quick note to let you know that I won’t be in the office tomorrow.","translation":"این فقط یک یادداشت سریع است تا به شما اطلاع دهم که فردا در دفتر نخواهم بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667889.mp3"},{"sentence":"a suicide note (= a note telling someone that you are going to kill yourself )","translation":"یادداشت خودکشی (= یادداشتی که به کسی می گوید که خودت را می کشی)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667893.mp3"},{"sentence":"a thank you note (= a note to say thank you for something )","translation":"یادداشت تشکر (= یادداشتی برای تشکر از چیزی)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667897.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('dcbe2523-c54e-5f7a-a690-1318ac8bc123','fcb266bb-85b1-5eec-a450-1559046dad4f',4,'official letter','نامه رسمی','spoken & written','an official letter or document','[ countable ]','credit note , promissory note','نامه یا سند رسمی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('0b5b963a-9df3-5314-aaf0-b4dd401a77d4','fcb266bb-85b1-5eec-a450-1559046dad4f',5,'additional information','اطلاعات اضافی','spoken & written','a short piece of writing at the bottom of a page or at the end of a book or document which gives more information about something written in the main part','[ countable ]','footnote ( 1 )','نوشته کوتاهی در انتهای صفحه یا انتهای یک کتاب یا سند که اطلاعات بیشتری در مورد چیزی که در قسمت اصلی نوشته شده است می دهد.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The notes are at the back of the book.","translation":"یادداشت ها در پشت کتاب آمده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000251180.mp3"},{"sentence":"A set of guidance notes is provided to assist applicants in completing the form.","translation":"مجموعه ای از یادداشت های راهنمایی برای کمک به متقاضیان در تکمیل فرم ارائه شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667917.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('a2d66cfa-05a1-5319-b307-11c50d66d0d1','fcb266bb-85b1-5eec-a450-1559046dad4f',6,'music','موسیقی','spoken & written','a particular musical sound, or a symbol representing this sound','[ countable ]',null,'یک صدای موسیقی خاص یا نمادی که این صدا را نشان می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She has a good voice but has trouble hitting the high notes.","translation":"او صدای خوبی دارد اما در زدن نت های بالا مشکل دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667923.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('1435809d-6eba-5d9c-9250-509e767694b0','fcb266bb-85b1-5eec-a450-1559046dad4f',7,'money','پول','spoken & written','a piece of paper money worth a particular amount of money','[ countable ]',null,'یک تکه پول کاغذی به ارزش مقدار مشخصی پول','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a ten-pound note","translation":"یک اسکناس ده پوندی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000251156.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('b324af82-21e3-5ea9-9048-4970f7dfc3b7','fcb266bb-85b1-5eec-a450-1559046dad4f',8,'feeling or quality','احساس یا کیفیت','spoken & written','a type of feeling or quality when someone speaks or does something','[ singular ]',null,'نوعی احساس یا کیفیت وقتی کسی صحبت می کند یا کاری انجام می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"There was a note of doubt in her voice.","translation":"یک نت شک در صدایش بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001760679.mp3"},{"sentence":"He brought a note of realism into the debate.","translation":"او نکته ای از واقع گرایی را وارد بحث کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001760680.mp3"},{"sentence":"She ended her speech on a personal note.","translation":"او سخنرانی خود را با یک یادداشت شخصی به پایان رساند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001667942.mp3"},{"sentence":"On a more serious note, I’d like to thank everyone for all their support.","translation":"در یک یادداشت جدی تر، مایلم از همه برای حمایت هایشان تشکر کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001760683.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
