online.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787952.mp3"},{"sentence":"Do you see that building over there ?","translation":"آیا آن ساختمان را می بینی؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001787953.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
