('4c254aa2-bf0c-5d37-8e34-887bafa3ee28','6a84af5d-991b-5540-af14-f7b15f069b38',1,'joined together','به هم پیوستند','spoken & written','an object that is made from two similar parts that are joined together',null,null,'جفت، جوفت (سگ/کفش)؛ زوج (رقص)؛ جفت (گوش)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"two pairs of jeans","translation":"دو جین","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000391804.mp3"},{"sentence":"a pair of black tights","translation":"یک جوراب شلواری مشکی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001537027.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
