('a426d275-a983-5b8b-b037-482dc25ac6fc','5ad5e81e-1c4a-5e3c-9bfa-661ec4391ae4',1,'piece','قطعه','spoken & written','a piece or feature of something such as an object , area, event, or period of time','[ countable ]',null,'بخش، قسمت؛ نقش (نمایش)؛ بخش (بازی)؛ اندام','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the early part The school dates from the early part of the nineteenth century.','the first part In the first part of the book he describes his childhood.','the later part (= the part towards the end of a period of time ) in the later part of the twentieth century','the latter part (= the second half rather than the first ) The festival lasts for ten days during the latter part of May.','the last/final part We had reached the last part of our journey.','the best/worst part The worst part was having to work even when it was raining.','the hard/easy part Deciding what you’re going to cook is the easy part.','an important part Fresh fruit is an important part of our diet.','a vital/essential part (= an extremely important and necessary part ) A ceasefire in the region is an essential part of any peace process.','an integral part (= a necessary part of the whole thing ) These workshops are an integral part of the course.','different parts of something Public transport varied between different parts of the country.','all parts of something ( also every part of something ) He had access to all parts of the factory.','the component/constituent parts of something (= the separate parts that form it ) The body is a complex thing with many constituent parts.','equal parts I cut the orange into four equal parts.','parts of the world There are wars going on in many parts of the world.','parts of the country He sometimes went to visit friends in other parts of the country.','parts of the body The cancer may spread to other parts of the body.','part one/two/three etc The questionnaire is in two parts: part one asks for your personal details and part two asks for your comments on the course.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The front part of the car was damaged.","translation":"قسمت جلوی خودرو آسیب دیده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000366881.mp3"},{"sentence":"In parts of Canada, French is the first language.","translation":"در بخش هایی از کانادا، زبان فرانسوی زبان اول است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000366882.mp3"},{"sentence":"The cost of living is becoming unbearable for retired people in our part of the world (= where we live ) .","translation":"هزینه زندگی برای افراد بازنشسته در قسمت ما (= جایی که ما زندگی می کنیم) غیر قابل تحمل می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001558829.mp3"},{"sentence":"More heat is lost through the head than any other part of the body .","translation":"بیش از هر قسمت دیگری از بدن گرما از طریق سر از دست می رود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001558834.mp3"},{"sentence":"in the early part of the 19th century","translation":"در اوایل قرن نوزدهم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020159.mp3"},{"sentence":"The best part of the holiday was the food.","translation":"بهترین قسمت تعطیلات غذا بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000366893.mp3"},{"sentence":"You can see the final part of that series on Tuesday.","translation":"می توانید قسمت پایانی آن سریال را روز سه شنبه ببینید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001558840.mp3"},{"sentence":"I shall be explaining this further in Part Two.","translation":"در قسمت دوم بیشتر توضیح خواهم داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001558841.mp3"},{"sentence":"Getting Dad to agree will be the hard part.","translation":"جلب رضایت پدر بخش سختی خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000366896.mp3"},{"sentence":"The jobs attracted people from all parts of the world.","translation":"این مشاغل مردم را از تمام نقاط جهان جذب می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001558847.mp3"},{"sentence":"the traditions that are an integral part of Jewish life","translation":"سنت هایی که بخشی جدایی ناپذیر از زندگی یهودیان است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001839637.mp3"},{"sentence":"The film is very violent in parts.","translation":"فیلم در قسمت هایی بسیار خشن است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001558850.mp3"}]'::jsonb,12),
