('b8411b99-dc68-544b-97eb-1e5a631db414','1d978df0-5d86-5094-b5d4-97a627411d5f',2,null,null,'spoken & written','sympathy for a person or animal who is suffering or unhappy','[ uncountable ]',null,'همدردی با شخص یا حیوانی که رنج می کشد یا ناراضی است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['feel pity (for somebody) No one can look at these photographs and not feel pity.','take/have pity (on somebody) (= feel sorry for someone and treat them with sympathy ) He was expecting a prison sentence but the judge took pity on him.','be filled with pity/full of pity His heart was filled with pity for them.','a feeling/sense of pity Annie experienced a sudden feeling of pity for the young man.','a wave/surge of pity The woman looked so dejected that a wave of pity washed over me.','a twinge/stab of pity (= a small feeling of pity ) Charles even felt a twinge of pity for Mrs Sweet.','an object of pity (= someone who people feel sorry for ) He was a proud man and he didn''t want to be treated as an object of pity.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He looked exhausted, but Marie felt no pity for him.","translation":"او خسته به نظر می رسید، اما ماری برای او ترحم نمی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001538763.mp3"},{"sentence":"I listened to Jason’s story with pity.","translation":"من با تاسف به داستان جیسون گوش دادم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000331848.mp3"},{"sentence":"I hated the thought of being an object of pity (= someone who other people feel sorry for ) .","translation":"من از این فکر متنفر بودم که مورد ترحم قرار بگیرم (= کسی که دیگران برایش متاسف شوند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001538767.mp3"},{"sentence":"He sounded so upset that Leah started to take pity on him.","translation":"او آنقدر ناراحت به نظر می رسید که لیا شروع به ترحم بر او کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000331859.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('e5a629d0-91eb-5e58-9236-010c130d37ef','1d978df0-5d86-5094-b5d4-97a627411d5f',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'for pity’s sake','ترحم، شفقت؛ حیف، غم (تأکید)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
