('9479abc2-facd-597d-bbf3-2eb0c9e9bd20','a458ab61-0278-5701-adcb-46a809738c1f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to add more information',null,null,'برای افزودن اطلاعات بیشتر استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He’s been studying hard for exams. Plus he’s been working in a bar at night.","translation":"او به سختی برای امتحانات درس می خواند. به علاوه او شب ها در یک بار کار می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000342212.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('8e776879-f2c0-570b-be5e-eed9c2823620','d28fcab4-45c6-5784-9886-27f76882aaa9',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a piece of writing that expresses emotions , experiences , and ideas , especially in short lines using words that rhyme (= end with the same sound )',null,null,'شعر، سروده؛ شعر (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['write a poem I’ve been writing short stories and poems for years.','compose a poem formal (= write a poem ) He composed a poem in his head.','learn a poem (= learn it so that you can remember it without reading it ) Hugh had learned the whole poem by heart as a boy.','memorize a poem (= learn it ) The children had to memorize a poem and recite it in front of the whole class.','recite a poem (= say it without reading it ) The little girl was standing up, reciting a poem.','a book/volume/collection of poems She has a new collection of poems coming out soon.','an anthology of poems (= a book of poems by different people ) She gave me an anthology of poems for children.','a love poem Shakespeare''s beautiful love poems','a lyric/narrative/epic etc poem (= a poem in a particular style ) the epic Greek poem, The Odyssey']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I decided to write a poem about how I felt.","translation":"تصمیم گرفتم در مورد احساسم شعر بنویسم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001766049.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
