('f423a363-80c4-564a-9508-b52cd927ddab','d605fb1a-d4d9-5fce-97c6-3cc7ae284ec9',1,'sport','ورزش','spoken & written','a competition in which people or animals compete to run, drive etc fastest and finish first','[ countable ]',null,'مسابقه، پیشتازی؛ نژاد (مردم)؛ نژاد (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['compete in a race ( also take part in a race ) He is competing in his first race this year. Runners from all over the world will take part in the race.','have a race Let’s have a race!','hold a race The race will be held on February 25th.','win/lose a race He did not win another race that season.','come first/last etc in a race ( also finish first/last etc in a race ) She came third in the race.','lead the race (= be ahead of everyone else ) He led the race from start to finish.','finish the race Congratulations to Matthew, who finished the race in three hours 17 minutes.','run a race I thought I ran a good race.','enter somebody/something in a race The horse is entered in a race at Worcester the day after tomorrow.','tough/hard He said he expected the race to be tough.','the big race (= an important race ) There are only three days to go until the big race.','a 3000 metres/10 km etc race He finished first in the 100 metres race.','a horse/boat/bike etc race It’s legal to gamble on horse races.','a road race (= when people run, cycle etc on ordinary roads ) She regularly competes in 10 kilometre road races.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He will be the youngest runner in the race.","translation":"او جوان ترین دونده در این مسابقه خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570853.mp3"},{"sentence":"Over 80 cars will take part in the race.","translation":"بیش از 80 خودرو در این مسابقه شرکت خواهند کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000469408.mp3"},{"sentence":"the annual boat race between Oxford and Cambridge Universities","translation":"مسابقه سالانه قایق بین دانشگاه های آکسفورد و کمبریج","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570857.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('07547e7e-f580-5f62-91aa-f63d3d05a775','d605fb1a-d4d9-5fce-97c6-3cc7ae284ec9',2,'people','مردم','informal','one of the main groups that humans can be divided into according to the colour of their skin and other physical features','[ countable, uncountable ]','human race','یکی از اصلی ترین گروه هایی است که انسان ها را می توان با توجه به رنگ پوست و سایر ویژگی های ظاهری خود به آن تقسیم کرد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The school welcomes children of all races .","translation":"مدرسه پذیرای کودکان از هر نژاد است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570876.mp3"},{"sentence":"a person of mixed race","translation":"فردی از نژادهای مختلط","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000469422.mp3"},{"sentence":"The law forbids discrimination on the grounds of race or religion.","translation":"قانون تبعیض بر اساس نژاد یا مذهب را ممنوع کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000469421.mp3"},{"sentence":"The 1960s produced a new race of young novelists.","translation":"دهه 1960 نژاد جدیدی از رمان نویسان جوان ایجاد کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570888.mp3"},{"sentence":"Are schools breeding (= producing ) a race of children incapable of making decisions for themselves?","translation":"آیا مدارسی که نژادی از کودکان را پرورش می دهند (= تولید می کنند) قادر به تصمیم گیری برای خودشان نیستند؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570889.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('aee88f7e-8c9f-5246-899b-e9c736fff691','d605fb1a-d4d9-5fce-97c6-3cc7ae284ec9',3,'get/do something first','اول دستیابی/انجام کاری','spoken & written','a situation in which one group of people tries to obtain or achieve something before another group does','[ singular ]','arms race , rat race','وضعیتی که در آن یک گروه از افراد قبل از اینکه گروهی دیگر به چیزی دست یابند تلاش می کنند تا چیزی را به دست آورند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"More and more drug companies are joining the race to beat cancer.","translation":"شرکت‌های دارویی بیشتر و بیشتری به رقابت برای غلبه بر سرطان می‌پیوندند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570897.mp3"},{"sentence":"The race is on to develop more environmentally friendly forms of energy.","translation":"مسابقه برای توسعه انواع انرژی سازگار با محیط زیست ادامه دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570898.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('5c3169f7-998e-550e-81bb-879d8e61c2c2','d605fb1a-d4d9-5fce-97c6-3cc7ae284ec9',4,'do something quickly','سریع کاری انجام بده','spoken & written','a situation in which you have to do something very quickly because you have very little time available','[ singular ]',null,'موقعیتی که در آن باید کاری را خیلی سریع انجام دهید زیرا زمان بسیار کمی در اختیار دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It is now a race to find the killer.","translation":"اکنون مسابقه ای برای یافتن قاتل است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570908.mp3"},{"sentence":"The pilot then began a desperate race against time to land the plane before it ran out of fuel.","translation":"سپس خلبان مسابقه ای ناامیدکننده با زمان را آغاز کرد تا هواپیما را قبل از تمام شدن سوخت فرود آورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570911.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('117ef781-c4fb-51a0-8871-1de8db096fed','d605fb1a-d4d9-5fce-97c6-3cc7ae284ec9',5,'prize/power','جایزه/قدرت','spoken & written','a situation in which people are competing with each other to win a prize or obtain a position of power','[ singular ]',null,'وضعیتی که در آن افراد برای بردن جایزه یا کسب مقام قدرت با یکدیگر رقابت می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Mr Bird has now officially joined the race for the White House.","translation":"آقای برد اکنون رسما به رقابت برای کاخ سفید پیوسته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570919.mp3"},{"sentence":"He is no longer in the race for academic awards.","translation":"او دیگر در رقابت برای جوایز دانشگاهی نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570923.mp3"},{"sentence":"the race to host the next Olympic Games","translation":"رقابت برای میزبانی بازی های المپیک بعدی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570929.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('92c4f092-cc27-55db-98ed-f95682e03677','d605fb1a-d4d9-5fce-97c6-3cc7ae284ec9',6,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the races','مسابقه، پیشتازی؛ نژاد (مردم)؛ نژاد (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('2940ca3b-276d-5ad7-a6ad-39ce9219e53c','153cda45-a5cd-5642-84c9-83592339c7d6',1,'sport','ورزش','spoken & written','to compete against someone or something in a race','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'رقابت با کسی یا چیزی در یک مسابقه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She’ll be racing against some of the world’s top athletes.","translation":"او با برخی از برترین ورزشکاران جهان مسابقه خواهد داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000469514.mp3"},{"sentence":"Stevens will not be racing in the final due to a knee injury.","translation":"استیونز به دلیل مصدومیت از ناحیه زانو در فینال شرکت نخواهد کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570938.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ll race you to the end of the road.","translation":"من شما را تا انتهای جاده مسابقه خواهم داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000469517.mp3"},{"sentence":"He will be racing a Ferrari in this year’s Formula One championships.","translation":"او در مسابقات قهرمانی فرمول یک امسال با یک فراری مسابقه خواهد داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000469522.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('f80b26fc-7c0d-53f6-a214-b3e43f12f27f','153cda45-a5cd-5642-84c9-83592339c7d6',2,'move quickly','به سرعت حرکت کنید','spoken & written','to move very quickly or take someone or something to a place very quickly','[ intransitive, transitive always + adverb/preposition ]',null,'خیلی سریع حرکت کردن یا خیلی سریع کسی یا چیزی را به جایی رساندن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He raced into the village on his bike.","translation":"او با دوچرخه خود وارد روستا شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570941.mp3"},{"sentence":"I had to race home for my bag.","translation":"مجبور شدم برای کیفم به خانه بروم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000469531.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was raced to hospital.","translation":"او را به بیمارستان بردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000469534.mp3"},{"sentence":"He raced to meet her.","translation":"برای دیدار با او دوید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570946.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('678f1a7e-fcb1-5ba3-a767-e04df084d667','153cda45-a5cd-5642-84c9-83592339c7d6',3,'do something quickly','سریع کاری انجام بده','spoken & written','to try to do something very quickly because you want to be the first to do it, or because there is very little time available','[ intransitive ]',null,'سعی کنید کاری را خیلی سریع انجام دهید زیرا می خواهید اولین کسی باشید که آن را انجام می دهد یا به دلیل اینکه زمان بسیار کمی در دسترس است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Investors are racing to buy shares in the new hi-tech companies.","translation":"سرمایه گذاران در حال رقابت برای خرید سهام در شرکت های جدید فناوری پیشرفته هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570954.mp3"},{"sentence":"The astronauts are racing against time to repair the spaceship.","translation":"فضانوردان برای تعمیر سفینه فضایی با زمان مسابقه می دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570957.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('faec7872-dfc0-5cee-9fb0-5f528e2fa026','153cda45-a5cd-5642-84c9-83592339c7d6',4,'heart/mind','قلب / ذهن','spoken & written','if your heart or mind races, it works harder and faster than usual , for example because you are afraid or excited','[ intransitive ]',null,'اگر قلب یا ذهن شما تند تند بزند، سخت تر و سریع تر از حد معمول کار می کند، مثلاً به این دلیل که می ترسید یا هیجان زده هستید.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"My heart was racing and my knees shook uncontrollably.","translation":"قلبم تند می زد و زانوهایم بی اختیار می لرزید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000469553.mp3"},{"sentence":"My mind was racing, trying to think where I had seen him before.","translation":"ذهنم تند می زد و سعی می کردم فکر کنم قبلا کجا او را دیده بودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570958.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('a180b8ca-0678-5c85-b46f-b15dd8de1720','153cda45-a5cd-5642-84c9-83592339c7d6',5,'engine','موتور','spoken & written','if an engine races, it runs too fast','[ intransitive ]',null,'اگر یک موتور مسابقه دهد، خیلی سریع کار می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('7fb1e6e7-a1ef-5fd6-8b65-00467de434fa','5c1ba123-a7fe-5994-905b-96038ccb9ce0',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the railway system','[ uncountable ]',null,'ریل، ریل (قطار)؛ ریل (در)؛ راه‌آهن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the rail network/system (= the system of railway lines in a country ) The government has spent £2 billion on improving the country''s rail network.','a rail service People want a safe, reliable rail service.','a rail ticket a first-class rail ticket','a rail fare Rail fares are to increase by up to 9.4%.','rail travel They had introduced measures to make rail travel safer.','a rail passenger Rail passengers will have to pay more for their tickets next year.','a rail crash Police have named four more victims of the Selby rail crash.','a rail link (= that makes train travel between two places possible ) He proposed building a high-speed rail link between the two airports.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the American rail system","translation":"سیستم ریلی آمریکا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001628444.mp3"},{"sentence":"a high-speed rail network","translation":"یک شبکه ریلی پرسرعت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001876035.mp3"},{"sentence":"Passengers want a better rail service .","translation":"مسافران خدمات ریلی بهتری می خواهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001876038.mp3"},{"sentence":"the Channel Tunnel and its rail links with London","translation":"تونل مانش و ارتباط ریلی آن با لندن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001876042.mp3"},{"sentence":"We continued our journey by rail.","translation":"سفرمان را با راه آهن ادامه دادیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001628447.mp3"},{"sentence":"I need to buy a rail ticket .","translation":"من باید بلیط راه آهن بخرم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001628448.mp3"},{"sentence":"cheap rail fares","translation":"کرایه راه آهن ارزان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769889.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('64bb78ed-f4f6-5d46-8e03-3e81fb64461d','5c1ba123-a7fe-5994-905b-96038ccb9ce0',2,null,null,'spoken & written','one of the two long metal tracks fastened to the ground that trains move along','[ countable ]',null,'یکی از دو ریل فلزی طولانی که به زمین بسته شده و قطارها در امتداد آن حرکت می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the rail network/system (= the system of railway lines in a country ) The government has spent £2 billion on improving the country''s rail network.','a rail service People want a safe, reliable rail service.','a rail ticket a first-class rail ticket','a rail fare Rail fares are to increase by up to 9.4%.','rail travel They had introduced measures to make rail travel safer.','a rail passenger Rail passengers will have to pay more for their tickets next year.','a rail crash Police have named four more victims of the Selby rail crash.','a rail link (= that makes train travel between two places possible ) He proposed building a high-speed rail link between the two airports.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
