('95869e34-43b5-5846-b7c3-d8f6090c5f77','fa12d9d3-d8b0-56ec-99de-05a04cab73ce',2,null,null,'spoken & written','used to emphasize a bad or undesirable quality','[ only before noun ]',null,'برای تأکید بر کیفیت بد یا نامطلوب استفاده می شود',array['total']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"an example of this government’s rank stupidity","translation":"نمونه ای از حماقت رتبه ای این دولت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000475683.mp3"},{"sentence":"They make us look like rank amateurs (= not at all good or professional ) .","translation":"آنها ما را شبیه آماتورهای رتبه ای می کنند (= اصلا خوب یا حرفه ای نیستند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000475682.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('0c01796a-37a7-58fc-847e-5277552a9e38','fa12d9d3-d8b0-56ec-99de-05a04cab73ce',3,null,null,'spoken & written','rank plants are too thick and have spread everywhere',null,null,'گیاهان درجه یک خیلی ضخیم هستند و در همه جا پخش شده اند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"rank grass and weeds","translation":"علف ها و علف های هرز را رتبه بندی کنید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001772706.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('5eab50f5-742b-5909-8ff1-b2eed2221d72','b7a15884-5668-5a0f-9c8a-0695ed4a4aad',1,null,null,'spoken & written','not seen or found very often, or not happening very often',null,null,'نادر، کمیاب؛ استثنایی (فرصت)؛ کم‌رو (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"This species of plant is becoming increasingly rare.","translation":"این گونه گیاهی به طور فزاینده ای کمیاب می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000476246.mp3"},{"sentence":"I only saw Helen on the rare occasions when I went into her shop.","translation":"هلن را فقط در موارد نادری که به مغازه اش رفتم دیدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001772739.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is rare to find such an interesting group of people.","translation":"به ندرت می توان چنین گروه جالبی از افراد را پیدا کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001772743.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is very rare for her to miss a day at school.","translation":"بسیار نادر است که او یک روز را در مدرسه غیبت کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001772746.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('f002329a-71ff-5f25-81b3-fef7c0c68ef0','b7a15884-5668-5a0f-9c8a-0695ed4a4aad',2,null,null,'spoken & written','meat that is rare has only been cooked for a short time and is still red',null,null,'گوشتی که کمیاب است فقط برای مدت کوتاهی پخته شده و هنوز قرمز است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I like my steak rare.","translation":"من استیک خود را کمیاب دوست دارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000476257.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c02f4592-d202-5646-944c-2e3b6d0ee4d5','b7a15884-5668-5a0f-9c8a-0695ed4a4aad',3,null,null,'old-fashioned','very good or surprising','[ only before noun ]',null,'خیلی خوب یا غافلگیر کننده','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We had a rare old time at the party.","translation":"ما یک دوره نادر قدیمی در مهمانی داشتیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000476264.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('26aa3112-23bd-521a-bf94-9c5f51a06ad3','cc0c3df0-71c5-5561-b0b2-99de3be72098',1,'number','شماره','spoken & written','the number of times something happens, or the number of examples of something within a certain period',null,'birthrate , death rate','نرخ، نرخ (مالی)؛ آهنگ (ضربان)؛ نرخ (سوخت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['high Rates of adult illiteracy are still too high.','low The hospital’s death rate is the lowest in the region.','a rising/falling rate A falling mortality rate led to a gradual increase in the proportion of the aged in the population.','the unemployment rate In April, the unemployment rate fell to 4.9 percent, a 23-year low.','the death/mortality rate The death rate among the homeless is three times higher than the rest of the population.','the birth rate In many developing countries, birth rates are falling.','the crime rate Our crime rate is one of the lowest in the country.','the divorce rate The UK has one of the highest divorce rates in Europe.','the success/failure rate The success rate is still extremely low.','the survival rate The survival rate of twins and triplets has increased in recent years.','somebody’s heart/pulse rate (= the number of beats per minute ) A miner’s resting heart rate can be between 40 and 60 beats a minute.','metabolic rate (= the rate at which the body changes food into energy ) Metabolic rate rises with any form of activity.','the rate goes up ( also the rate rises/increases more formal ) The crime rate just keeps going up.','the rate goes down ( also the rate falls/decreases more formal ) We are expecting unemployment rates to fall.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Australia’s unemployment rate rose to 6.5% in February.","translation":"نرخ بیکاری استرالیا در ماه فوریه به 6.5 درصد افزایش یافت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001565463.mp3"},{"sentence":"a rapid increase in the divorce rate","translation":"افزایش سریع نرخ طلاق","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001565464.mp3"},{"sentence":"areas with high rates of crime","translation":"مناطقی با نرخ بالای جرم و جنایت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000476743.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s a new technique and the failure rate is quite high.","translation":"این یک تکنیک جدید است و میزان شکست بسیار بالا است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001772771.mp3"},{"sentence":"Immediately his heart rate (= the number of beats per minute ) increased.","translation":"بلافاصله ضربان قلب او (= تعداد ضربان در دقیقه) افزایش یافت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001565465.mp3"},{"sentence":"Asylum seekers were entering Britain at a rate of 1,600 per day.","translation":"هر روز 1600 پناهجو وارد بریتانیا می شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001772775.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('a4c11555-e322-5f01-9ede-e680ba82c98b','cc0c3df0-71c5-5561-b0b2-99de3be72098',2,'money','پول','spoken & written','a charge or payment that is set according to a standard scale',null,'base rate , → cut-rate , exchange rate , interest rate , prime rate','هزینه یا پرداختی که بر اساس یک مقیاس استاندارد تنظیم می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"people who pay tax at the highest rate","translation":"افرادی که مالیات را با بالاترین نرخ پرداخت می کنند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001772781.mp3"},{"sentence":"They only pay tax at a rate of 5%.","translation":"آنها فقط با نرخ 5 درصد مالیات می پردازند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001772782.mp3"},{"sentence":"another reduction in the mortgage rate","translation":"کاهش دیگری در نرخ وام مسکن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001772786.mp3"},{"sentence":"Nurses are demanding higher rates of pay.","translation":"پرستاران خواهان افزایش حقوق هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000476753.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some hotels offer special rates for children.","translation":"برخی از هتل ها نرخ های ویژه ای را برای کودکان ارائه می دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001565478.mp3"},{"sentence":"What’s the hourly rate for cleaning?","translation":"نرخ ساعتی نظافت چقدر است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000476757.mp3"},{"sentence":"$20 an hour is the going rate (= the usual amount paid ) for private tuition.","translation":"20 دلار در ساعت نرخ شروع (= مبلغ معمول پرداختی) برای شهریه خصوصی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001772787.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
