olesterol is one of the risk factors associated with heart disease.','risk assessment (= a calculation of how much risk is involved in something ) Engineering risk assessment is based on objective scientific criteria.','there is a risk There is always a risk that mistakes will be made.','an element/degree of risk (= some risk, but not much ) There is always an element of risk in flying.','be worth the risk Don’t walk home alone at night – it’s not worth the risk.','the risks involved/the risks associated with something The soldiers were well aware of the risks involved. The public are unwilling to accept the risks associated with nuclear energy.','the benefits outweigh the risks (= they are more important than the possible risks ) The benefits to patients who are taking the drug far outweigh the risks.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Drivers under 21 are regarded as poor risks by insurance companies.","translation":"رانندگان زیر 21 سال از سوی شرکت های بیمه به عنوان خطرات ضعیف در نظر گرفته می شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000755395.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('96b90d71-887f-54be-bb6b-a48455ab8fa3','a3c4e82a-3c26-513d-83c5-7ed4b972e966',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to put something in a situation in which it could be lost, destroyed , or harmed',null,null,'قرار دادن چیزی در موقعیتی که ممکن است گم شود، از بین برود یا آسیب ببیند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"When children start smoking, they don’t realize that they’re risking their health.","translation":"وقتی کودکان شروع به سیگار کشیدن می کنند، متوجه نمی شوند که سلامت خود را به خطر می اندازند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000755405.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s prepared to risk everything to avoid this war.","translation":"او آماده است تا همه چیز را به خطر بیندازد تا از این جنگ جلوگیری کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001579336.mp3"},{"sentence":"You’d be crazy to risk your money on an investment like that!","translation":"شما دیوانه خواهید بود که پول خود را با چنین سرمایه گذاری به خطر بیندازید!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000755408.mp3"},{"sentence":"He risked his life helping others to escape.","translation":"او جان خود را به خطر انداخت و به دیگران کمک کرد تا فرار کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770307.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m not going to risk my neck (= risk my life ) just to save a common criminal.","translation":"من قصد ندارم گردنم را به خطر بیندازم (= جانم را به خطر بیندازم) فقط برای نجات یک جنایتکار معمولی.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770313.mp3"},{"sentence":"Why risk life and limb (= risk your life and health ) jumping out of a plane just to raise money for charity?","translation":"چرا زندگی و دست و پا (= جان و سلامتی خود را به خطر می اندازد) که فقط برای جمع آوری پول برای امور خیریه از هواپیما بیرون می پرید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770320.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('9d5f33e4-041d-59ea-9c7b-fa3b0c407a63','a3c4e82a-3c26-513d-83c5-7ed4b972e966',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to get into a situation where something unpleasant may happen to you',null,null,'وارد موقعیتی شوید که ممکن است اتفاق ناخوشایندی برای شما بیفتد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They may even risk losing their homes.","translation":"آنها حتی ممکن است خطر از دست دادن خانه های خود را داشته باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001579343.mp3"},{"sentence":"He would prefer not to risk another embarrassing defeat.","translation":"او ترجیح می دهد ریسک شکست شرم آور دیگری را نپذیرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000755426.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some people are prepared to risk imprisonment for what they believe.","translation":"برخی از افراد به خاطر اعتقادی که دارند، آماده خطر زندان هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001579344.mp3"},{"sentence":"Workers who broke the strike risked being attacked when they left the factory.","translation":"کارگرانی که اعتصاب را شکستند، هنگام خروج از کارخانه در معرض خطر حمله قرار گرفتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000755429.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('053a74b1-e56b-5748-abcb-c334f1ab6336','a3c4e82a-3c26-513d-83c5-7ed4b972e966',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to do something that you know may have dangerous or unpleasant results',null,null,'انجام کاری که می دانید ممکن است نتایج خطرناک یا ناخوشایندی داشته باشد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Are you prepared to risk traveling without an armed guard?","translation":"آیا آماده هستید که بدون نگهبان مسلح سفر کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000755435.mp3"},{"sentence":"She risked a glance back over her shoulder.","translation":"او با خطر یک نگاه به پشت روی شانه اش.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001579347.mp3"},{"sentence":"You could slip out of school between classes, but I wouldn’t risk it .","translation":"شما می توانید بین کلاس ها از مدرسه خارج شوید، اما من ریسک نمی کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000755439.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('ab7b3865-6076-5220-b142-c6169b1895d6','1e815fce-853c-51b5-af2b-71f1e5e38734',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a specially prepared hard surface for cars , buses , bicycles etc to travel on','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'جاده، خیابان؛ جاده (خارج شهر)؛ مسیر (زندگی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['busy (= with a lot of traffic ) The children have to cross a busy road to get to school.','quiet (= with little traffic ) At that time of night, the roads were quiet.','clear (= with no traffic or nothing blocking it ) Before you overtake, make sure the road is clear.','a main road (= an important road that is used a lot ) The main road was blocked for twenty-five minutes.','a minor road France has a huge network of minor roads.','a side road/a back road (= a small road that is not used much ) He drove into a quiet side road and stopped the car.','a country road He was driving along a quiet country road when a tyre suddenly burst.','a mountain road A lot of concentration is needed on the narrow mountain roads.','the coast road He continued along the coast road.','the open road (= a road without much traffic or anything to stop you getting somewhere ) This car is at its best on the open road.','a road is open (= it is not closed or blocked ) We try to keep the mountain road open for most of the year.','a road is closed The mountain road was closed by snow.','a road is blocked The main road was blocked for an hour while police cleared the accident.','cross a road She was standing on the pavement waiting to cross the road.','run out into a road He had to swerve when a child ran out into the road.','a road leads/goes/runs somewhere We turned into the road leading to the village.','a road winds (= it turns and curves, rather than going in a straight line ) A long road wound through the park.','a road forks (= it starts going ahead in two different directions ) At Salen, the road forks right and left.','a road narrows/widens After a couple of miles, the road narrows.','a road accident Her husband was killed in a road accident.','road safety We share parents’ concern for road safety.','road sense (= knowledge of how to behave safely near traffic ) Young children don’t have any road sense.','a road junction (= place where two or more roads meet ) It was a busy road junction.','a road network (= system of roads that cross or are connected to each other ) the road network in northern France','the side of the road We stopped and had something to eat by the side of the road. She was standing on the other side of the road talking to my mum.','the road ahead (= in front of you ) The road ahead was completely flooded.','a fork in the road (= a place where a road goes in two different directions ) We had to ask for directions each time we got to a fork in the road.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I was driving along the road when a kid suddenly stepped out in front of me.","translation":"در حال رانندگی در جاده بودم که ناگهان یک بچه از جلوی من بیرون آمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020204.mp3"},{"sentence":"You’ll see the library a bit further up the road.","translation":"کتابخانه را کمی جلوتر از جاده خواهید دید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770376.mp3"},{"sentence":"I ran down the road to see what was happening.","translation":"از جاده دویدم تا ببینم چه خبر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770377.mp3"},{"sentence":"My sister lives just down the road.","translation":"خواهرم همین پایین جاده زندگی می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001366.mp3"},{"sentence":"Protestors sat down in the road to stop the lorries.","translation":"معترضان در جاده نشستند تا کامیون ها را متوقف کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001367.mp3"},{"sentence":"Someone was standing in the middle of the road.","translation":"یک نفر وسط راه ایستاده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001971716.mp3"},{"sentence":"I ran across the road to meet him.","translation":"برای ملاقات با او از جاده دویدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770373.mp3"},{"sentence":"The college is easily accessible by road.","translation":"دسترسی به کالج از طریق جاده آسان است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001971730.mp3"},{"sentence":"There are far more cars on the road now than there used to be.","translation":"در حال حاضر خودروهای زیادی در جاده ها نسبت به گذشته وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001368.mp3"},{"sentence":"There were lots of cars parked on the road.","translation":"ماشین های زیادی در جاده پارک شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001369.mp3"}]'::jsonb,10),
