('2d77bca7-ab4e-5cd3-8046-fa6c69b8bf50','f129fb5c-e92b-5dad-830b-f4b85dd26f5a',1,'stone','سنگ','spoken & written','the hard substance that forms the main surface of the Earth','[ uncountable ]',null,'سنگ، صخره؛ راک (نوع موسیقی)؛ سنگ (معدنی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['solid rock Steps had been carved out of the solid rock.','bare rock (= not covered by soil ) Here there was only bare rock and gravel.','volcanic rock The fossils are sandwiched between two layers of volcanic rock.','molten rock (= rock that is so hot it is liquid ) Molten rock flowed into these cracks.','a rock formation There are marvellous views of impressive rock formations.','rock forms/is formed From the texture of the rock we can tell how it was formed.','something erodes rock (= it gradually removes the surface of the rock ) Rainwater drained away, forming streams and rivers that began to erode the rock.','rock erodes (away) (= its surface is gradually removed because of the action of water, wind etc ) The rocks had eroded away over the years.','a lump/piece of rock His leg was trapped under a large lump of rock.','a layer of rock You can see six layers of rock in the cliff.','an outcrop of rock (= a mass of rock that sticks up above the ground ) The gulls nested on a outcrop of rock.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"To build the tunnel, they had to cut through 500 feet of solid rock .","translation":"برای ساختن این تونل، آنها مجبور شدند 500 فوت سنگ جامد را برش دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000756606.mp3"},{"sentence":"Most of the country is desert and bare rock .","translation":"بیشتر کشور صحرا و صخره های برهنه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001773930.mp3"},{"sentence":"massive rock formations (= shapes made naturally from rock )","translation":"صخره های عظیم (= اشکال ساخته شده به طور طبیعی از سنگ)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001605204.mp3"},{"sentence":"ancient dark volcanic rock","translation":"سنگ آتشفشانی تیره باستانی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001773934.mp3"},{"sentence":"Jack stood on a rock for a better view.","translation":"جک روی یک صخره ایستاد تا دید بهتری داشته باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001605212.mp3"},{"sentence":"During the storm a ship had been driven onto the rocks (= a line of rocks under or next to the sea ) .","translation":"در طوفان کشتی بر روی صخره ها (= صفی از صخره ها در زیر یا کنار دریا) رانده شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000756621.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
