('53e30f56-a039-5b9e-8428-95e45e03f38b','2e3f95ac-ae21-5064-8d0c-8de78dcc53fe',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the way in which someone or something is involved in an activity or situation, and how much influence they have on it',null,null,'نقش، وظیفه؛ نقش (بازی)؛ سهم (نسبت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['play/have a role He played a prominent role in the company’s success.','take on a role ( also assume a role formal ) (= start having it ) Mr Jones took on the role of spokesperson for the organization.','take a role Britain began to take a more active role in the affairs of Europe.','give somebody a role Health experts should be given a key role in developing the correct procedures.','cast somebody in a role written (= give someone a role, especially one they do not want ) He found himself cast in the role of guide and translator.','an important/major role She played an important role in her husband’s political career.','a key/central role The report recognized the key role of teachers.','a vital/crucial/essential role Every member of the team has a vital role to play.','an active role (= when you do practical things to achieve particular aims ) She took an active role in the community.','a leading role (= the most important role ) They take a leading role in discussions.','a significant role Technology is already playing a significant role in classroom teaching.','a prominent role The military has played a prominent role in Burmese politics.','a dual role (= when someone or something does two things ) People have dual roles in society as producers and consumers.','somebody’s traditional role (= one based on ideas that have existed for a long time, without changing ) Some women are happy with their traditional role as carers.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"women’s role in society","translation":"نقش زنان در جامعه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001373.mp3"},{"sentence":"the role of diet in the prevention of disease","translation":"نقش رژیم غذایی در پیشگیری از بیماری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001774007.mp3"},{"sentence":"They want to limit the role of government.","translation":"آنها می خواهند نقش دولت را محدود کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001374.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('fe915680-c210-5e0a-b4fc-c3be642582d0','2e3f95ac-ae21-5064-8d0c-8de78dcc53fe',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the character played by an actor in a play or film',null,null,'شخصیتی که توسط یک بازیگر در یک نمایش یا فیلم بازی می شود',array['part']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Matthews plays the role of a young doctor suspected of murder.","translation":"ماتیوس نقش یک دکتر جوان مظنون به قتل را بازی می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000757300.mp3"},{"sentence":"A young actor named Johnny Depp was given the leading role.","translation":"بازیگر جوانی به نام جانی دپ نقش اصلی را بر عهده گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040189.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was Johansson''s first major movie role.","translation":"این اولین نقش مهم جوهانسون در سینما بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040190.mp3"},{"sentence":"The film features Paul Schofield in the title role.","translation":"در این فیلم پل اسکوفیلد در نقش اصلی حضور دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040191.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
