('6e96311b-a796-52b2-9a7f-368ee8ada8d5','ea1781d8-04b8-59c2-b606-e74ebe4b2ada',1,'in a building','در یک ساختمان','spoken & written','a part of the inside of a building that has its own walls , floor , and ceiling','[ countable ]','front room , living room , sitting room','اتاق، حیاط (اتاق)؛ فضا (اتاق)؛ جا (فضا)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I looked around the room.","translation":"به اطراف اتاق نگاه کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001575344.mp3"},{"sentence":"She nodded toward a man who was standing across the room (= on the other side of the room ) .","translation":"سرش را به سمت مردی تکان داد که آن طرف اتاق (= آن طرف اتاق) ایستاده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001575339.mp3"},{"sentence":"Someone was laughing in the next room (= the one beside the one you are in ) .","translation":"یک نفر در اتاق بغلی می خندید (= آنی که در کنار آنی که شما در آن هستید) .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000729442.mp3"},{"sentence":"Beth, it’s time to clean up your room.","translation":"بث، وقت آن است که اتاق خود را تمیز کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001575330.mp3"},{"sentence":"the doctor’s waiting room","translation":"اتاق انتظار دکتر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000729441.mp3"},{"sentence":"a three-room apartment","translation":"یک آپارتمان سه اتاقه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000729443.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’d like to book a double room for two nights.","translation":"من می خواهم یک اتاق دو نفره برای دو شب رزرو کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001773790.mp3"},{"sentence":"Here’s your key – room 348.","translation":"اینجا کلید شماست - اتاق 348.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000729444.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
('69868e13-72b5-5824-bbb3-9b59958ea34d','ea1781d8-04b8-59c2-b606-e74ebe4b2ada',2,'space','فضا','spoken & written','space somewhere for a particular thing, person, or activity','[ uncountable ]','elbow-room','فضایی برای یک چیز، شخص یا فعالیت خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I hope there’s going to be enough room in the fridge.","translation":"امیدوارم فضای کافی در یخچال وجود داشته باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001575354.mp3"},{"sentence":"My suitcase was so full I didn’t have room for anything else.","translation":"چمدانم آنقدر پر بود که جای هیچ چیز دیگری نداشتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001575362.mp3"},{"sentence":"The museum doesn’t have enough room to show everything in their collection.","translation":"موزه فضای کافی برای نمایش همه چیز در مجموعه خود ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000729467.mp3"},{"sentence":"There’s plenty of room in the boot for your luggage.","translation":"فضای زیادی در صندوق عقب برای چمدان شما وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001773798.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m trying to make room for a vegetable garden in the backyard.","translation":"من سعی می کنم در حیاط خلوت فضایی را برای یک باغ سبزیجات باز کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000729476.mp3"},{"sentence":"Step back, leave room for people to get past.","translation":"یک قدم به عقب برگردید، جایی برای عبور از مردم بگذارید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000729480.mp3"},{"sentence":"The old wardrobe took up too much room .","translation":"کمد لباس قدیمی فضای زیادی را اشغال کرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000729484.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
