p008-001588128.mp3"},{"sentence":"direct rule from Westminster","translation":"حکومت مستقیم از وست مینستر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000733948.mp3"},{"sentence":"the restoration of majority rule (= government by the party that most people have voted for ) to Northern Ireland","translation":"اعاده حکومت اکثریت (=حکومت حزبی که اکثر مردم به آن رای داده اند) به ایرلند شمالی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001588133.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
